/api.github.com/users/arielfikru/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arielfikru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arielfikru/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arielfikru","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arielfikru/anivora/commits/80b4e82e03d5e2ec1b0ed76a1d1980de7c9a5905/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-15T07:34:46Z","email":"arielfikrua@gmail.com","name":"arielfikru"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-15T07:34:46Z","email":"arielfikrua@gmail.com","name":"arielfikru"},"message":"feat(video): migrate storage to Cloudflare R2, drop Bunny.net\n\nBunny Stream suffered frequent downtime, so video storage now uses\nCloudflare R2 (S3-compatible) serving progressive H.264/AAC mp4 from a\npublic CDN domain. Uploads transcode to faststart mp4 (existing ffmpeg\npipeline) and stream to R2 via multipart upload; episodes become\nplayable (\"ready\", or \"published\" when the season auto-publishes) as\nsoon as the upload finishes — no separate processing/poll step.\n\nBunny integration is removed entirely: service/port, HLS URL builders,\nTUS direct-upload ticket, webhook handler, status poller, sync use case,\nand the CDN proxy route. The browser upload now POSTs to the server\nupload route, which stores to R2. The watch page plays a native <video>\n(src = mp4Url ?? legacy playbackUrl) instead of the Bunny iframe.\n\nAlready-uploaded Bunny episodes are left untouched: their DB columns are\nkept (no destructive migration) and their HLS playbackUrl is still handed\nto the native player for clients with HLS support.\n\n- env: drop BUNNY_*/VIDEO_PROVIDER; R2_* now required\n- schema 0005: add episode.mp4_url, hls_url, storage_provider\n- repo: attachBunny -> attachVideo; drop findByBunnyVideoId\n- new: ObjectStorage port + R2 service (@aws-sdk/client-s3 + lib-storage)\n- web: drop tus-js-client; remove sync-status action; R2/mp4 copy","tree":{"sha":"9d2a7fdb5b32eddab6d79a4009be1482f93161d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arielfikru/anivora/git/trees/9d2a7fdb5b32eddab6d79a4009be1482f93161d3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arielfikru/anivora/git/commits/80b4e82e03d5e2ec1b0ed76a1d1980de7c9a5905","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71917936?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arielfikru/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arielfikru/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arielfikru/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arielfikru/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arielfikru","id":71917936,"login":"arielfikru","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxOTE3OTM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arielfikru/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arielfikru/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arielfikru/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arielfikru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arielfikru/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arielfikru","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/arielfikru/anivora/commit/80b4e82e03d5e2ec1b0ed76a1d1980de7c9a5905","node_id":"C_kwDOSnCHVdoAKDgwYjRlODJlMDNkNWUyZWMxYjBlZDc2YTFkMTk4MGRlN2M5YTU5MDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/arielfikru/anivora/commit/6dcc87f07db543b1d982bd6eab45e4045608e93f","sha":"6dcc87f07db543b1d982bd6eab45e4045608e93f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arielfikru/anivora/commits/6dcc87f07db543b1d982bd6eab45e4045608e93f"}],"sha":"80b4e82e03d5e2ec1b0ed76a1d1980de7c9a5905","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arielfikru/anivora/commits/80b4e82e03d5e2ec1b0ed76a1d1980de7c9a5905"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71917936?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arielfikru/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arielfikru/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arielfikru/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arielfikru/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arielfikru","id":71917936,"login":"arielfikru","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxOTE3OTM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arielfikru/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arielfikru/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arielfikru/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arielfikru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arielfikru/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arielfikru","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arielfikru/anivora/commits/6dcc87f07db543b1d982bd6eab45e4045608e93f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T16:16:47Z","email":"arielfikrua@gmail.com","name":"arielfikru"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T16:16:47Z","email":"arielfikrua@gmail.com","name":"arielfikru"},"message":"fix(upload): surface Google Drive error pages instead of silent scan failure\n\nWhen Drive returns an HTML error page (quota exceeded, restricted link)\ninstead of the file, the body was saved to disk, failed archive detection,\nand produced a misleading ''No video files found in source'' error.\n\nDetect a lingering text/html response after the confirm replay and throw\nDrive''s own caption (e.g. quota exceeded) so the job fails with a clear\nmessage.","tree":{"sha":"0a3fb1de0decd82a73c588b21859709de970eef4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arielfikru/anivora/git/trees/0a3fb1de0decd82a73c588b21859709de970eef4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arielfikru/anivora/git/commits/6dcc87f07db543b1d982bd6eab45e4045608e93f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71917936?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arielfikru/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arielfikru/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arielfikru/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arielfikru/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arielfikru","id":71917936,"login":"arielfikru","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxOTE3OTM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arielfikru/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arielfikru/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arielfikru/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arielfikru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arielfikru/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arielfikru","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/arielfikru/anivora/commit/6dcc87f07db543b1d982bd6eab45e4045608e93f","node_id":"C_kwDOSnCHVdoAKDZkY2M4N2YwN2RiNTQzYjFkOTgyYmQ2ZWFiNDVlNDA0NTYwOGU5M2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/arielfikru/anivora/commit/922f5325184a4ac883b5fff83a55dae8376b9e34","sha":"922f5325184a4ac883b5fff83a55dae8376b9e34","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arielfikru/anivora/commits/922f5325184a4ac883b5fff83a55dae8376b9e34"}],"sha":"6dcc87f07db543b1d982bd6eab45e4045608e93f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arielfikru/anivora/commits/6dcc87f07db543b1d982bd6eab45e4045608e93f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71917936?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arielfikru/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arielfikru/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arielfikru/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arielfikru/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arielfikru","id":71917936,"login":"arielfikru","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxOTE3OTM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arielfikru/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arielfikru/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arielfikru/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arielfikru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arielfikru/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arielfikru","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arielfikru/anivora/commits/922f5325184a4ac883b5fff83a55dae8376b9e34/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-05T07:59:10Z","email":"arielfikrua@gmail.com","name":"arielfikru"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-05T07:59:10Z","email":"arielfikrua@gmail.com","name":"arielfikru"},"message":"feat(upload): server-side remote upload to Bunny\n\nAdd admin \"Remote upload\" on the Uploads page: fetch a direct video URL,\na Google Drive public link, or a zip/rar archive on the server and push it\nto Bunny Stream — no local file needed.\n\nTwo-phase background job (remote_upload_job + in-process worker):\n- download (streamed to a work volume) -> extract -> scan video files\n- admin maps each scanned file to an episode number (bulk-creating missing\n  episodes) -> worker uploads to Bunny\n\nBunny ingest details:\n- bsdtar (libarchive) extracts zip and rar/RAR5; Alpine''s 7zip/p7zip carry\n  no rar codec and proprietary unrar was dropped\n- every video is transcoded/remuxed to H.264/AAC mp4 (+faststart) before\n  upload so Bunny''s MP4-fallback serves a playable file; already-compatible\n  streams are stream-copied\n- BunnyService.uploadVideoStream streams the file (no in-memory buffering)\n\nInfra: image gains libarchive-tools + ffmpeg; compose adds a work_data\nvolume, UPLOAD_WORK_DIR / REMOTE_UPLOAD_MAX_BYTES, and a larger app\nmem/cpu budget for GB-scale download+transcode+upload.","tree":{"sha":"a6e5839ef4bead2397ae2b8c9c13d56fb420a757","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arielfikru/anivora/git/trees/a6e5839ef4bead2397ae2b8c9c13d56fb420a757"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arielfikru/anivora/git/commits/922f5325184a4ac883b5fff83a55dae8376b9e34","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71917936?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arielfikru/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arielfikru/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arielfikru/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arielfikru/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arielfikru","id":71917936,"login":"arielfikru","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxOTE3OTM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arielfikru/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arielfikru/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arielfikru/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arielfikru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arielfikru/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arielfikru","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/arielfikru/anivora/commit/922f5325184a4ac883b5fff83a55dae8376b9e34","node_id":"C_kwDOSnCHVdoAKDkyMmY1MzI1MTg0YTRhYzg4M2I1ZmZmODNhNTVkYWU4Mzc2YjllMzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/arielfikru/anivora/commit/72474386bc5dc9b7e8ed1b97b452ce861221bf8d","sha":"72474386bc5dc9b7e8ed1b97b452ce861221bf8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arielfikru/anivora/commits/72474386bc5dc9b7e8ed1b97b452ce861221bf8d"}],"sha":"922f5325184a4ac883b5fff83a55dae8376b9e34","url":"https://api.gith