{"date":"2026-09-20T14:58:51Z","email":"kinlane@gmail.com","name":"Kin Lane"},"message":"Restore business capability map (tag -> capability edges)\n\ncapabilities/<slug>-capability-edges.yml had gone missing from this repository — deleted\nfrom the working tree, and in some repos the deletion was swept into an unrelated commit\nby a `git add -A` publish step. Restored from git history where it had been committed,\notherwise regenerated from the original classification sweep. Content is unchanged from\nthe sweep: edges at confidence >= 0.7 whose evidence was found verbatim in the contract.\n\nCapability definitions are Turbo EA Capabilities, CC BY 4.0; the attribution travels\ninside the file.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"37585773991deba0d6f50e5a2dd1847e62489f02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/api-evangelist/commerce-layer/git/trees/37585773991deba0d6f50e5a2dd1847e62489f02"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/api-evangelist/commerce-layer/git/commits/d1d8539126a39f448206440c4219cba1b4e23bec","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kinlane","id":56100,"login":"kinlane","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MTAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/subscription