lowers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kinlane","id":56100,"login":"kinlane","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MTAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/api-evangelist/commerce-layer/commits/948dd324385747cbdaccd5c2f1269e9f0503907d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T10:22:18Z","email":"kinlane@gmail.com","name":"Kin Lane"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T10:22:18Z","email":"kinlane@gmail.com","name":"Kin Lane"},"message":"Arazzo: repoint sources and declare business capabilities (roadmap#201, #205)\n\nsourceDescriptions rebuilt against the refined per-tag OpenAPIs — refine-openapis\nhad archived the originals into openapi/_original/ and 92% of references dangled,\nso these workflows were not forkable or runnable.\n\ninfo.x-realizes-capability-ids declares which business capability each workflow\nrealises, derived deterministically through the tag/capability edges, with\nx-capability-derivation recording the spec and confidence behind every id.\n\nCapability definitions: Turbo EA Capabilities, CC BY 4.0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1e4ac1dcd441c747469bb7608a8f17017a7fd874","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/api-evangelist/commerce-layer/git/trees/1e4ac1dcd441c747469bb7608a8f17017a7fd874"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/api-evangelist/commerce-layer/git/commits/948dd324385747cbdaccd5c2f1269e9f0503907d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kinlane","id":56100,"login":"kinlane","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MTAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/api-evangelist/commerce-layer/commit/948dd324385747cbdaccd5c2f1269e9f0503907d","node_id":"C_kwDOSnCHyNoAKDk0OGRkMzI0Mzg1NzQ3Y2JkYWNjZDVjMmYxMjY5ZTlmMDUwMzkwN2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/api-evangelist/commerce-layer/commit/fee79ff1b860b5302013460398964ee661e507c8","sha":"fee79ff1b860b5302013460398964ee661e507c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/api-evangelist/commerce-layer/commits/fee79ff1b860b5302013460398964ee661e507c8"}],"sha":"948dd324385747cbdaccd5c2f1269e9f0503907d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/api-evangelist/commerce-layer/commits/948dd324385747cbdaccd5c2f1269e9f0503907d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kinlane","id":56100,"login":"kinlane","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MTAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/api-evangelist/commerce-layer/commits/fee79ff1b860b5302013460398964ee661e507c8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T23:18:42Z","email":"kinlane@gmail.com","name":"Kin Lane"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T23:18:42Z","email":"kinlane@gmail.com","name":"Kin Lane"},"message":"Publish the delivery model — what was measured, not a new score (roadmap#41)\n\nA composite is presented as one comparable number across every provider and it is\nnot: a self-hosted 51.7 and a SaaS 51.7 were produced by asking the same\nquestions of two products where several questions only make sense for one.\n\nModelling on roadmap#39 showed the fix is NOT to adjust the scores — exempting\nthe commercial checks moved the open-source cohort mean 41.9 -> 42.0 and cost\nseveral providers a band. The number is close to right. What was missing is the\nlabel saying what was measured.\n\n  saas         15,295   unknown      11,061\n  open-core       447   library         428   self-hosted     368\n\nThe 40% unknown is honest rather than guessed: a product licence is on record for\n1,191 providers, and only 914 carry an SPDX name the classifier can read.","tree":{"sha":"3c8fc08715552d99c4af11e80c6bb2f661181bc9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/api-evangelist/commerce-layer/git/trees/3c8fc08715552d99c4af11e80c