sers/kinlane/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kinlane","id":56100,"login":"kinlane","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MTAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/api-evangelist/commerce-layer/commits/ccaf3793a02b063e18861d2a4d99bc8015a423ff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T21:48:10Z","email":"kinlane@gmail.com","name":"Kin Lane"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T21:48:10Z","email":"kinlane@gmail.com","name":"Kin Lane"},"message":"Repoint Arazzo sourceDescriptions at the refined per-tag OpenAPIs\n\nrefine-openapis splits each spec by tag and archives the source into\nopenapi/_original/. These workflows still pointed at the archived filenames, so\n92% of local sourceDescriptions resolved to nothing and the workflows were not\nforkable or runnable — the entire point of the corpus. See roadmap#205.\n\nDeterministic, not re-authored: refine splits BY TAG, so every operation now has\nexactly one home. Each step operationId was resolved by index and the\nsourceDescriptions rebuilt from what the steps actually use.\n\nA file with ANY unresolvable operationId was skipped whole and reported. A\npartially repointed workflow is worse than a broken one — it looks fixed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5d67eb7e24820de7748534ee55db497a1091628b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/api-evan