profile covers all three public APIs:\n\n- Core API (OpenAPI 3.1, 917 paths, 130+ resources) — orders, SKUs, customers,\n  markets, prices, shipments, promotions, webhooks\n- Provisioning API (48 paths) — organizations, memberships, API credentials,\n  identity providers\n- Metrics API — orders/carts/returns/usage analytics + FBT helper, with\n  Commerce Layer''s local MCP server linked\n\nArtifacts: 3 live OpenAPI mirrors, 16 Naftiko capabilities (8 Core, 4 Provisioning,\n4 Metrics), 2 JSON Schemas (Order, SKU), 1 JSON-LD context, plans + rate-limits\n+ FinOps. Rate limits captured at sliding-window resolution per the docs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"440d0aa1f1caf25f69d18c882480d4d633ee3788","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/api-evangelist/commerce-layer/git/trees/440d0aa1f1caf25f69d18c882480d4d633ee3788"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/api-evangelist/commerce-layer/git/commits/0d7ddda6e8ca0c66591b711d08ecb8c558e4869d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kinlane","id":56100,"login":"kinlane","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MTAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinlane/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kinl