e_password column, agent.created_by_admin\n  notification event, and the new POST admin/agents endpoint.\n\nREADME.md: update feature inventory and API reference to reflect the\n  admin-created agent flow and the forced password-change gate.\n\nCLIENT_SYSTEM_DOCUMENTATION.md: add admin-created agent section explaining\n  the offline partnership onboarding path.\n\nEMAIL_NOTIFICATION_CONTENT_REVIEW.md: add agent.created_by_admin email\n  content (subject, variables, body structure).\n\nFULL_LIVE_QA_TEST_GUIDE.md: add QA test cases for the full admin-create\n  flow — form validation, duplicate email, welcome email delivery,\n  forced password-change gate, and referral code generation.\n\nTGA_CRM_MASTER_REFERENCE.md / PROJECT_HISTORY.md: updated to reflect\n  the new feature and migration 087.","tree":{"sha":"600b121655edb0d7e083804655b943268f33b45e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/trees/600b121655edb0d7e083804655b943268f33b45e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/commits/35943a80edec912d48ac0c8d45fc2ace377af4e3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115913516?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prashanttiw","id":115913516,"login":"prashanttiw","node_id":"U_kgDOBuizLA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/star