0:00Z","email":"tprashant76640@gmail.com","name":"prashanttiw"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T08:50:00Z","email":"tprashant76640@gmail.com","name":"prashanttiw"},"message":"feat(ui): admin-created agent panel + forced password-change flow\n\nAdminAgentsPage — CreateAgentPanel (SlideOver):\n  - ''Add Agent'' button in PageHeader, gated by agents.create permission\n  - SlideOver form with all required fields (first/last name, agency, email,\n    mobile, country, address/city/state) + optional fields (alt mobile,\n    business reg number, partnership scope)\n  - useMutation wired to createAdminAgent(); on success: shows referral code\n    in toast, resets form, closes panel, invalidates agent list queries\n  - Agent list rows and detail modal both show a ShieldCheck badge with\n    ''Added by {admin name}'' when created_by_admin_name is present\n\nAgentProfilePage — forced password-change UX:\n  - Reads mustChangePassword from useAuth store\n  - On mount: if mustChangePassword is true, auto-opens the password panel\n  - Shows an amber warning banner prompting the user to set a new password\n  - On successful change: calls updateMustChangePassword(false) to release\n    the gate immediately; shows a contextual ''Welcome'' toast instead of\n    the generic ''Password changed'' message\n  - Cancel button hidden while mustChangePassword is active (can''t dismiss)\n\nRoleGuard:\n  - If user.mustChangePassword is true and the path is not /portal/agent/profile,\n    redirect to /portal/agent/profile — blocks access to the rest of the\n    agent portal until the temp password is replaced","tree":{"sha":"b248023c5a7bb4e38e0d16254d0ad35737c468d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/trees/b248023c5a7bb4e38e0d16254d0ad35737c468d9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/commits/b8d1117c6653fbd47d00b5ee00329a9426c7f2e0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"veri