hub.com/users/prashanttiw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prashanttiw","id":115913516,"login":"prashanttiw","node_id":"U_kgDOBuizLA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/commits/75518e9db78d84e807461db5471a949c20c7aa19/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T05:30:00Z","email":"tprashant76640@gmail.com","name":"prashanttiw"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T05:30:00Z","email":"tprashant76640@gmail.com","name":"prashanttiw"},"message":"feat(api-client/auth): createAdminAgent() + mustChangePassword state\n\napi.ts:\n  - createAdminAgent() — POST admin/agents with full agent creation payload;\n    returns { id, referral_code } from the backend response\n  - AuthUser type: add must_change_password boolean field (mapped from JWT\n    session payload added in the backend commit)\n  - AdminAgentDetail type: add created_by_admin_name nullable string field\n\nuseAuth.ts:\n  - User interface: add mustChangePassword boolean\n  - mapAuthUser(): map apiUser.must_change_password → user.mustChangePassword\n  - updateMustChangePassword(value): new action that patches mustChangePassword\n    in the Zustand store immediately, letting AgentProfilePage release the\n    forced-change redirect the instant the password change succeeds without\n    needing a full session re-fetch","tree":{"sha":"43881e92ed2e2389d59d5162dffcdb0d9ff5c1e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/trees/43881e92ed