blic"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/commits/832938c6b81ceccc7bfa10114ae5506ec43b8f3d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T09:17:52Z","email":"tprashant76640@gmail.com","name":"prashanttiw"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T09:17:52Z","email":"tprashant76640@gmail.com","name":"prashanttiw"},"message":"docs(history): record GitHub Actions CI/CD setup\n\nDocuments the new build-verification pipeline, the two real bugs\nfound while wiring it up (no typescript dependency + 90 latent type\nerrors never caught before; openspout''s stale PHP 8.2/8.3 platform-req\nmetadata), and what was deliberately left out (no auto-deploy, no\nbranch protection) per this project''s working-mode rules.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"95f27f966f55519101aea855abd8d1121dca6c57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/trees/95f27f966f55519101aea855abd8d1121dca6c57"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/commits/832938c6b81ceccc7bfa10114ae5506ec43b8f3d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115913516?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prashanttiw","id":115913516,"login":"prashanttiw","node_id":"U_kgDOBuizLA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com