''Or connect with'' divider\n\nContactPage: rebuilt with direct email desks (In-Country Representation,\n  UNI Collaboration, B2B Agent Partnership, Admissions, Careers) and live\n  office map using updated COMPANY.offices data\n\nHomePage: remove CostOfLivingSlider and DailyDrillWidget lazy imports (not ready)\n\nHome components (Hero, HowItWorks, Stats, Testimonials, CTABanner, Footer,\nHeader): copy/content refresh aligned with updated COMPANY data\n\nLanding app widgets (ai-matcher, comparison-lab, document-butler, hero,\nlive-alumni-feed, student-dashboard-preview, cost-of-living-slider):\n  content and copy updates\n\nindex.html / site.webmanifest: updated meta description and OG tags\n  to student-facing messaging\n\ncrm-api/Database/.htaccess: deny direct HTTP access to the Database directory\n\nscripts/exclude.txt: updated deploy exclusion list\n\ndocs: add DEPLOYMENT_MASTER_RUNBOOK.md and PRODUCTION_SETUP_RUNBOOK.md\n  (Bluehost no-SSH deployment process)\n\nCLAUDE.md / README.md: correct PHP version (8.3 on production, not 8.2),\n  correct MySQL target (5.7.23 confirmed, not 8.4), document MySQL 5.7\n  incompatibilities, note archive-old-logs.php is intentionally unscheduled,\n  update cron PHP binary reference ea-php82→ea-php83, add runbook links","tree":{"sha":"e456d8c6dea1ffcb3776d5e53073880b6ffdf26a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/trees/e456d8c6dea1ffcb3776d5e53073880b6ffdf26a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/commits/93e09cef28a2e1e481685e72caa5854e00c3f10f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115913516?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/following{/other_user}","gists