b.com/users/prashanttiw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/commits/7f90a613a2453e221096377a194fc74b4f34b418/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T07:51:58Z","email":"tprashant76640@gmail.com","name":"prashanttiw"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T07:51:58Z","email":"tprashant76640@gmail.com","name":"prashanttiw"},"message":"feat(ui/filters): URL-persistent filters across all list pages\n\nAdd useUrlFilters hook + ClearFiltersButton shared component. Syncs every\npage''s filter state (search, status dropdowns, date ranges, pagination page)\nto the URL query string instead of plain useState. Benefits:\n  - Filters survive navigating away to a detail view and pressing browser back\n  - Shareable/bookmarkable filtered URLs\n  - No behaviour change when no filters are set (clean URL)\n\nApplied to all admin list pages (Agents, Applications, Commissions, Courses,\nIntakes, Leads, Logs, Notices, Reassignments, Security, Students, SuperLogs,\nUniversities, Users), agent portal pages (Applications, Commissions, Dashboard,\nLogs, Notices, Students) and student portal pages (Notices, Overview).\n\nAdminDashboardPage: also removes the unused pendingPayments / agentQueue /\nfetchAdminPaymentQueue / fetchAdminAgentQueue code paths and corrects the\ninitial document status filter from ''pending'' to ''submitted''.","tree":{"sha":"5e7d76724dd79945b9c5bb820715bb14f3313a2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/trees/5e7d76724dd79945b9c5bb820715bb14f3313a2b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/commits/7f90a613a2453e221096377a194fc74b4f34b418","verification":{"payload":null,"