rl":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prashanttiw","id":115913516,"login":"prashanttiw","node_id":"U_kgDOBuizLA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/commits/5a65b7d84119be6bece71cad26bd25a9ed22863d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T07:50:41Z","email":"tprashant76640@gmail.com","name":"prashanttiw"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T07:50:41Z","email":"tprashant76640@gmail.com","name":"prashanttiw"},"message":"fix(api): user_preferences JSON INSERT + document queue filter + api.ts params\n\nuser_preferences INSERT sites (4 callsites across Registration, Leads,\nStudent, SubAgent controllers): supply preferences column value explicitly\nas ''{}'' on every INSERT. Required because MySQL 5.7 disallows column DEFAULTs\non JSON columns (schema fix in prior commit removes the DEFAULT); without the\nexplicit value the INSERT fails with a ''Field doesn''t have a default value''\nerror on production.\n\nDocumentRequestController — getDocumentQueue:\n  Previously hard-coded to status=''submitted'' with no LIMIT. Now accepts\n  ?status= (validated against allowlist) and ?per_page= (clamped 1–100,\n  default 30), enabling the admin dashboard to request exactly 6 submitted\n  documents without over-fetching the entire queue.\n\napi.ts — fetchAdminDocumentQueue:\n  Pass status and per_page query params to the new backend. Previously the\n  function ignored all its parameters and never sent them to the API.\n\nreal_catalog_seed.sql: regenerated 2026-07-16 to pick up catalog entries\n  added since the 2026-07-04/07-08 version; header comment updated to match.","tree":{"sha":"7f595269a582ccfbecde15833f303cb8616aac89","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/trees/7f595269a582ccfbecde15833f303cb8616aac89"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/commits/5a65b7d84119be6bece71cad26bd25a9ed22863d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115913516?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prashanttiw","id":115913516,"login":"prashanttiw","node_id":"U_kgDOBuizLA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/commit/5a65b7d84119be6bece71cad26bd25a9ed22863d","node_id":"C_kwDOSnGKsNoAKDVhNjViN2Q4NDExOWJlNmJlY2U3MWNhZDI2YmQyNWE5ZWQyMjg2M2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/commit/ae7142dbd0d00fd0c86ff774d18536857667bcc3","sha":"ae7142dbd0d00fd0c86ff774d18536857667bcc3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/commits/ae7142dbd0d00fd0c86ff774d18536857667bcc3"}],"sha":"5a65b7d84119be6bece71cad26bd25a9ed22863d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/commits/5a65b7d84119be6bece71cad26bd25a9ed22863d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115913516?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prashanttiw","id":115913516,"login":"prashanttiw","node_id":"U_kgDOBuizLA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/commits/ae7142dbd0d00fd0c86ff774d18536857667bcc3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T07:50:04Z","email":"tprashant76640@gmail.com","name":"prashanttiw"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T07:50:04Z","email":"tprashant76640@gmail.com","name":"prashanttiw"},"message":"fix(api): rewrite CTEs and window functions for MySQL 5.7\n\nProduction MySQL 5.7 has no CTE (WITH) and no window function support.\nThree queries replaced:\n\nAdminReportsController — agent leaderboard:\n  CTE replaced with a derived subquery; RANK() OVER (...) replaced with\n  the classic MySQL user-variable running counter (@tga_rank). The counter\n  is assigned in the OUTER query against an already-sorted-and-limited\n  derived table ''x'' to avoid the MySQL gotcha where assignment runs before\n  ORDER BY is applied.\n\nAdminReportsController — university stats:\n  WITH uni_metrics AS (...) replaced with an equivalent inline derived\n  subquery joined directly.\n\nAdminAgentController — agent subtree walk (getSubtree):\n  Recursive CTE replaced with a bounded 3-level UNION. Safe to bound at\n  self + children + grandchildren because the hierarchy is hard-capped at\n  3 tiers. Walks parent_agent_id (not root_agent_id) — root_agent_id has\n  a confirmed data gap in live data; parent_agent_id has zero orphans.\n\nCommissionModel — validateAgentChain:\n  Recursive CTE replaced with a 2-hop LEFT JOIN (self + parent + grandparent)\n  followed by a PHP-side check across the three returned IDs.","tree":{"sha":"607364a16789a9276fc511cd93563e2849e15b97","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/trees/607364a16789a9276fc511cd93563e2849e15b97"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/commits/ae7142dbd0d00fd0c86ff774d18536857667bcc3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115913516?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prashanttiw","id":115913516,"login":"prashanttiw","node_id":"U_kgDOBuizLA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/commit/ae7142dbd0d00fd0c86ff774d18536857667bcc3","node_id":"C_kwDOSnGKsNoAKGFlNzE0MmRiZDBkMDBmZDBjODZmZjc3NGQxODUzNjg1NzY2N2JjYzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/commit/bdc56136c3c14e97fc07c4fe3f4d1bf903243e42","sha":"bdc56136c3c14e97fc07c4fe3f4d1bf903243e42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/commits/bdc56136c3c14e97fc07c4fe3f4d1bf903243e42"}],"sha":"ae7142dbd0d00fd0c86ff774d18536857667bcc3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/commits/ae7142dbd0d00fd0c86ff774d18536857667bcc3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115913516?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prashanttiw","id":115913516,"login":"prashanttiw","node_id":"U_kgDOBuizLA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/commits/bdc56136c3c14e97fc07c4fe3f4d1bf903243e42/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T07:49:35Z","email":"tprashant76640@gmail.com","name":"prashanttiw"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T07:49:35Z","email":"tprashant76640@gmail.com","name":"prashanttiw"},"message":"fix(api/db): MySQL 5.7 compatibility — SKIP LOCKED, JSON DEFAULT, DROP COLUMN\n\nProduction confirmed as MySQL 5.7.23 (2026-07-16). Three incompatibilities fixed:\n\n1. Database.php — supportsSkipLocked() now parses the version string and sets\n   true only for MySQL >= 8. Previously returned true unconditionally for any\n   non-MariaDB server, causing a hard SQL syntax error on every cron run against\n   5.7. Safe default changed to false (omitting SKIP LOCKED is functionally\n   correct; assuming support when absent is a hard crash).\n\n2. migration 030 / schema.sql — remove DEFAULT (''{}'') on the JSON preferences\n   column. MySQL 5.7 disallows any DEFAULT value on JSON/TEXT/BLOB columns.\n   Every INSERT callsite already passes ''{}'' explicitly (enforced in the next\n   commit), so the column DEFAULT was redundant and prevented schema load.\n\n3. migration 084 — replace DROP COLUMN IF EXISTS (needs MySQL 8.0.29+) with\n   a stored procedure that inspects INFORMATION_SCHEMA.COLUMNS and issues a\n   conditional ALTER TABLE via PREPARE/EXECUTE. BINARY comparisons used on\n   column names to avoid the ''Illegal mix of collations'' error on 5.7.","tree":{"sha":"3903e95feea69080c9123cb0a7b10245bcf44a66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/trees/3903e95feea69080c9123cb0a7b10245bcf44a66"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/commits/bdc56136c3c14e97fc07c4fe3f4d1bf903243e42","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115913516?v=4","events_url":"