ions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/commits/2ccd29172c0c0fac83538f5651bdf3772666500f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T06:09:36Z","email":"tprashant76640@gmail.com","name":"prashanttiw"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T06:09:36Z","email":"tprashant76640@gmail.com","name":"prashanttiw"},"message":"fix(notifications): standardise portal_url/admin_url in notification payloads\n\nReplace every raw \\[''FRONTEND_URL''] fallback with\nEnvironment::get(''APP_FRONTEND_URL'') and correct the path suffix to match\nthe live router structure (/portal/<role>/):\n\n- LeadsController:   admin_url -> /portal/admin/leads (new-lead, status-changed,\n                     assigned); student portal_url on lead->student conversion\n- RegistrationController: student portal_url on self-registration\n- AdminAgentController:   agent portal_url included in agent.approved payload\n- AgentController:        admin_url included in agent.onboarding_submitted payload\n- NoticeController:       per-audience portal_url (student / agent / admin) fired\n                          in separate NotificationService::fire() calls so each\n                          recipient gets the correct role-specific link\n- ReassignmentController: admin_url -> /portal/admin/reassignments","tree":{"sha":"bb880bcfec2d2b81167eb80730b1c681d30f20d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/trees/bb880bcfec2d2b81167eb80730b1c681d30f20d5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/commits/2ccd29172c0c0fac83538f5651bdf3772666500f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115913516?v=4","events_url":"https://a