ents_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/commits/aeed689c2f4e42ecdbea9f5d769289708ea140a9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-14T06:00:00Z","email":"tprashant76640@gmail.com","name":"prashanttiw"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T06:00:00Z","email":"tprashant76640@gmail.com","name":"prashanttiw"},"message":"feat(ui): UniversityBrowse institution->campus->course 3-step flow\n\nReplace the 2-step (list->course) flow with a proper 3-step flow:\n1. Institution list (grouped cards, one per real-world university)\n2. Campus picker (select a specific campus — skipped automatically when the\n   institution has only one campus)\n3. Course list for the selected campus\n\nselectedUniversity state split into selectedGroup (institution card) +\nselectedCampus (specific campus row). campusesQuery fetches campus rows for\nthe selected institution via GET /universities/:pid/campuses.\n\nBreadcrumb now shows the full path: Universities > Institution > Campus > Course.\nbackToCampuses() helper navigates one step back.\n\nDelete ApplicationDetailDrawer.tsx — replaced by AdminApplicationDetailPage\n(routed full-page view, no more inline drawer state).\n\nRecentNoticesCard: new shared component that renders the 3 most recent notices\nfor the student overview dashboard with a ''View all'' link.\n\nStudentOverviewPage: add RecentNoticesCard to the overview layout.","tree":{"sha":"0585a34e2b66f0e8c1e10e1106cf67a9c37fecdc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/trees/0585a34e2b66f0e8c1e10e1106cf67a9c37fecd