e=1000) — fixes\n  a silent bug where the old flat picker capped at 250 while the catalog holds\n  313+ campus rows, making ~60 campuses unselectable\n- Campus dropdown appears when the selected institution has multiple campuses\n- Add Course form uses formCampusPicker to resolve institution → specific campus\n  before submitting\n\nAdminIntakesPage: same treatment — grouped university picker, independent\nfilterCampusPicker + formCampusPicker, campus dropdowns in both filter bar and\nCreate Intake form. effectiveFilterUniversityId / effectiveFormUniversityId\npassed to course and intake queries.\n\napi.ts: add fetchAdminUniversitiesLive view/partnershipType params + new\nfetchUniversityCampuses / fetchAdminUniversityCampuses helpers + CatalogCampus type.","tree":{"sha":"861cf4aa4796bc7f7de2b7517182c0d73d421cbf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/trees/861cf4aa4796bc7f7de2b7517182c0d73d421cbf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/commits/9dd6c35636ef1b941d59d3c02e47651b09cd8489","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115913516?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prashanttiw","id":115913516,"login":"prashanttiw","node_id":"U_kgDOBuizLA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_u