pe":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/commits/ce3e9b153097261cf0417ef2b8f5c12584e3cf52/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T12:30:00Z","email":"tprashant76640@gmail.com","name":"prashanttiw"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T12:30:00Z","email":"tprashant76640@gmail.com","name":"prashanttiw"},"message":"feat(api): UniversityModel.findGroupMembers + IntakeModel.delete + migration 085\n\nUniversityModel: add findGroupMembers(int \\, bool \\=true) — returns\nall campus rows belonging to the same institution as \\, including itself.\nA university with no siblings still returns as a single-item list so callers\nnever need to special-case ''no group''. Carries course_count per campus row.\n\nIntakeModel: add hard-delete delete(int \\) — intakes use hard-delete only\n(no deleted_at column, see 016_create_intakes_table.sql) but BaseModel has no\nhard-delete method, so IntakeController::delete() was calling a method that\nnever existed.\n\nMigration 085: brand remaining plaintext notification_templates as HTML so\nMailService::buildHtmlBody() wraps them in the branded email layout instead\nof sending bare text fragments.\n\nsetup_database.php: apply migration 085 after existing template seed.","tree":{"sha":"1ad6d35005e8ea4f89b516994d9646bca9afd5f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/trees/1ad6d35005e8ea4f89b516994d9646bca9afd5f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/commits/ce3e9b153097261cf0417ef2b8f5c12584e3cf52","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115913516?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/following{/other_user}",