.github.com/users/prashanttiw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/commits/53045e16be55e268964e6edc45d7945c61e172fe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T12:00:00Z","email":"tprashant76640@gmail.com","name":"prashanttiw"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T12:00:00Z","email":"tprashant76640@gmail.com","name":"prashanttiw"},"message":"feat(api): UniversityController grouped view + publicCampuses/adminCampuses endpoints\n\nadminList(): add ?view=grouped mode — collapses sibling campus rows (same\ncampus_group_id) into one card per institution for the Universities management\nlist. Flat view retained for course/intake pickers that need every individual\ncampus row selectable. Adds ?partnership_type= filter.\n\npublicList(): always grouped for student/agent browse — one card per real-world\ninstitution. Country filter now matches if ANY active campus in the group is in\nthat country.\n\npublicCampuses(): new endpoint GET /universities/:pid/campuses — returns all\nactive campus rows for the institution the :pid belongs to. Used by UniversityBrowse\ncampus picker step.\n\nadminCampuses(): new endpoint GET /admin/universities/:pid/campuses — same but\nnot restricted to status=''active''; used by AdminCoursesPage/AdminIntakesPage\ncampus pickers.\n\nUniversityRoutes: register both new routes.","tree":{"sha":"58cdfe568471d5d0a6153db12240cd9622e9e0a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/trees/58cdfe568471d5d0a6153db12240cd9622e9e0a5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/commits/53045e16be55e268964e6edc45d7945c61e172fe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned",