,"html_url":"https://github.com/prashanttiw","id":115913516,"login":"prashanttiw","node_id":"U_kgDOBuizLA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/commits/c27e51c7438e6551adbf4afa09adaa5abcf4b68e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T11:00:00Z","email":"tprashant76640@gmail.com","name":"prashanttiw"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T11:00:00Z","email":"tprashant76640@gmail.com","name":"prashanttiw"},"message":"fix(api): block resubmission of approved documents; add HtmlSanitizer service\n\nDocumentRequestController: guard agentSubmit() and studentSubmit() against\nresubmission when status=''approved'' — without this a student could silently swap\nthe approved file for a different one, and nothing would prompt an admin to\nre-review. Returns 409 ALREADY_APPROVED.\ndocumentReview(): ucfirst the status in the document.reviewed notification so\nemail shows ''Approved'' not ''approved''.\n\nNoticeController: replace inline strip_tags() with new HtmlSanitizer::clean()\nservice — shared implementation, easier to extend allowlist in one place.\nFixes softDeleteWithCascade() call (method doesn''t exist) → softDelete().\n\nHtmlSanitizer: new service wrapping strip_tags() with the TipTap safe-tag\nallowlist for notice content.","tree":{"sha":"512c6b832f7dbad412eeb95f33f2e486a88ecf82","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/trees/512c6b832f7dbad412eeb95f33f2e486a88ecf82"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prasha