_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/commits/59b76836b271f77a69ba73c8798ed2797af4b56d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T09:00:00Z","email":"tprashant76640@gmail.com","name":"prashanttiw"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T09:00:00Z","email":"tprashant76640@gmail.com","name":"prashanttiw"},"message":"fix(security): AdminDashboardController — add missing RBAC guards\n\nuserList(): gate ?role=student/agent on students.view/agents.view — without this\nany authenticated admin could pull the full student/agent roster with decrypted\nPII by hitting ?role=student directly, bypassing page grants entirely.\n\ngetUser(): gate profile fetch on the target''s own user_type module (students,\nagents, or user_management) — any authenticated admin could previously pull full\ndecrypted student PII (passport/DOB/nationality) for any user by public_id.\n\nupdateUserAccess() super_admin path: only super admins can promote to super admin\n— the weaker user_management.edit page grant was previously sufficient, letting\nany admin with Users write access mint new super admins.","tree":{"sha":"3c76475dff7101830e9d30adbbb411604043d2ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/trees/3c76475dff7101830e9d30adbbb411604043d2ee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/commits/59b76836b271f77a69ba73c8798ed2797af4b56d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115913516?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github