n the current page).\n\nAdminAgentsPage:\n- SearchInput wired; debouncedSearch passed to fetchAdminAgents as q param\n- Query key updated to include debouncedSearch so TanStack Query re-fetches\n  on change\n\nAdminApplicationsPage:\n- SearchInput wired; search passed to fetchAdminApplications\n- Searches reference_number, student name, course name, university name\n\nAdminCommissionsPage:\n- SearchInput wired; search passed to fetchAdminCommissions\n- Searches agent name, agency name, student name, reference number\n- Page resets to 1 on search change\n\nAdminStudentsPage:\n- SearchInput wired; server-side search on name, public_id, agency,\n  email (prefix hash), phone (prefix hash)\n\nAdminLeadsPage:\n- SearchInput wired; post-fetch filter on decrypted email + full_name\n  (leads has no prefix hash column — acceptable; all leads fetched in one shot)\n\nAdminNoticesPage:\n- SearchInput wired; server-side search on title and content\n\nAdminIntakesPage:\n- SearchInput wired; server-side search on intake/course/university name\n\nAdminUniversitiesPage:\n- SearchInput wired; q= now sent as server-side param (university name,\n  country, city, associated course/intake names via EXISTS)\n\nAdminDashboardPage:\n- Removes pendingAgentsPreview and pendingDocumentsPreview sections from the\n  overview tab (data no longer returned by summary() endpoint)","tree":{"sha":"e6afc0a921717add43e40c81084f79040bdaf58f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/trees/e6afc0a921717add43e40c81084f79040bdaf58f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/commits/72c37139a8b79357a57d95f0adc97145418bdf2a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115913516?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/followers"