//github.com/prashanttiw","id":115913516,"login":"prashanttiw","node_id":"U_kgDOBuizLA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/commits/e394e2d99a6cb36b5c97b7fda0858b483544a98c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-03T12:50:26Z","email":"tprashant76640@gmail.com","name":"prashanttiw"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-03T12:50:26Z","email":"tprashant76640@gmail.com","name":"prashanttiw"},"message":"docs(phases): record post-audit improvements in Phase 4, 7, and 9 append files\n\nPHASE_4_APPEND.md:\n- Documents flat paginated course + intake catalog list endpoints (fix for N+1\n  fan-out that caused rate-limit errors at 2,600+ courses)\n- Documents university campus schema (migrations 077/078) and import helpers\n- Documents system-settings dead-row cleanup (migration 079)\n\nPHASE_7_APPEND.md:\n- Documents Phase 7 activity feed / audit log split (own-actions vs super-log)\n- Documents SecurityEventLogger centralisation and rate-limit deduplication\n- Documents AdminPageAccessService read/write level upgrade\n- Documents AdminDashboardController BUG-RV fixes (DB column mismatches, PII\n  leakage, integer ID exposure, broken approve/reject agent routes) discovered\n  and fixed in independent re-verification session\n- Documents SecurityEventController actor-name resolution + per-viewer redaction\n- Documents RoleController deletion (dead CRUD)\n\nPHASE_9_APPEND.md:\n- Documents ActivityLabelFormatter + AgentHierarchy helper extraction\n- Documents user_agent capture in SecurityEventLogger\n- Documents AdminSuperLogsPage + AgentLogsPage new pages\n- Documents PageGuard read/write level upgrade","tree":{"sha":"1fe5cab60233eb2047539f08699d7784d13260ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/trees/1fe5cab60233eb2047539f08699d7784d13260ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/commits/e394e2d99a6cb36b5c97b7fda0858b483544a98c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115913516?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prashanttiw","id":115913516,"login":"prashanttiw","node_id":"U_kgDOBuizLA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/commit/e394e2d99a6cb36b5c97b7fda0858b483544a98c","node_id":"C_kwDOSnGKsNoAKGUzOTRlMmQ5OWE2Y2IzNmI1Yzk3YjdmZGEwODU4YjQ4MzU0NGE5OGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/commit/4ea92b7c236cf6914c5fd0fe13d5edcff967aac3","sha":"4ea92b7c236cf6914c5fd0fe13d5edcff967aac3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/commits/4ea92b7c236cf6914c5fd0fe13d5edcff967aac3"}],"sha":"e394e2d99a6cb36b5c97b7fda0858b483544a98c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/commits/e394e2d99a6cb36b5c97b7fda0858b483544a98c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115913516?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prashanttiw","id":115913516,"login":"prashanttiw","node_id":"U_kgDOBuizLA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/commits/4ea92b7c236cf6914c5fd0fe13d5edcff967aac3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-03T12:49:56Z","email":"tprashant76640@gmail.com","name":"prashanttiw"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-03T12:49:56Z","email":"tprashant76640@gmail.com","name":"prashanttiw"},"message":"fix(frontend): PageGuard read/write level; super-logs + agent-logs routes; nav updates\n\nPageGuard:\n- Accepts optional requiredLevel prop (''read'' | ''write'', defaults to ''read'')\n- Permission check now uses the new Record<string,PageAccessLevel> pages map:\n  ''read'' passes if the page key exists; ''write'' additionally requires the value\n  to equal ''write'' — previously treated all pages as a flat string array\n\nRouter (index.tsx):\n- Added /portal/admin/super-logs route → AdminSuperLogsPage (gated by\n  super_logs.view via PageGuard)\n- Added /portal/agent/logs route → AgentLogsPage\n- Removed /portal/admin/roles route (dead page)\n\nPortalWrapper:\n- Admin nav: added Super Logs item (visible only to callers with super_logs page\n  access); reordered Security below Logs for UX grouping\n- Agent nav: added Activity Logs item → /portal/agent/logs\n\nDashboardLayout:\n- Breadcrumb title now correctly resolves ''super-logs'' segment → ''Super Logs''\n  and ''logs'' → ''Activity Logs'' (was showing raw route segment)\n\nActivityFeedWidget:\n- Fixes data path for admin feed: response is now wrapped under data.data (the\n  controller returns { data: [...] }); widget previously read data directly\n  which returned undefined and silently showed an empty feed","tree":{"sha":"4f48fa77fc24a0b8d67345ee6b392e96df74713b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/trees/4f48fa77fc24a0b8d67345ee6b392e96df74713b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/commits/4ea92b7c236cf6914c5fd0fe13d5edcff967aac3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115913516?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prashanttiw","id":115913516,"login":"prashanttiw","node_id":"U_kgDOBuizLA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/commit/4ea92b7c236cf6914c5fd0fe13d5edcff967aac3","node_id":"C_kwDOSnGKsNoAKDRlYTkyYjdjMjM2Y2Y2OTE0YzVmZDBmZTEzZDVlZGNmZjk2N2FhYzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/commit/6f8358d30a715041c843e48471eecc8c7d71cf62","sha":"6f8358d30a715041c843e48471eecc8c7d71cf62","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/commits/6f8358d30a715041c843e48471eecc8c7d71cf62"}],"sha":"4ea92b7c236cf6914c5fd0fe13d5edcff967aac3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/commits/4ea92b7c236cf6914c5fd0fe13d5edcff967aac3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115913516?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prashanttiw","id":115913516,"login":"prashanttiw","node_id":"U_kgDOBuizLA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/commits/6f8358d30a715041c843e48471eecc8c7d71cf62/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-03T12:49:33Z","email":"tprashant76640@gmail.com","name":"prashanttiw"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-03T12:49:33Z","email":"tprashant76640@gmail.com","name":"prashanttiw"},"message":"fix(frontend): scope write controls behind canWrite permission in shared components\n\nApplicationDetailDrawer:\n- Status transition buttons (Move to X, Withdraw) wrapped in canWrite guard\n  using usePermission(''applications'',''edit''); read-only viewers see the full\n  detail but no mutation controls\n- Document request + payment creation forms also hidden when canWrite is false\n\nProfileCompletionPanel:\n- Complete rewrite of the student readiness wizard: was a static multi-step\n  placeholder, now fully wired to the backend readiness endpoints\n- Uploads map to the correct categories (photo, passport_front, passport_back,\n  academic_marksheet, transcript, cv, sop, lor); phd_thesis + phd_lor_professional\n  conditionally shown when planning_phd is true\n- Agent picker wired to GET /student/agents/directory with debounced search\n- Draft save (PUT readiness/draft) on every step advance; final step calls\n  POST readiness/submit\n- Blocks submission if required categories are missing; surfaces missing list\n\nEditableField:\n- Adds onBlur callback prop (triggered when edit mode is cancelled or committed\n  without change) so parent components can sync state without waiting for\n  onSave to fire","tree":{"sha":"2e3bc8fe38c357965712289ced7158f3c6a141e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/trees/2e3bc8fe38c357965712289ced7158f3c6a141e3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/commits/6f8358d30a715041c843e48471eecc8c7d71cf62","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115913516?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/events{/privacy}"