https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/commits/9c1783afb8633bc87001b7ccec561acf0f29ecd9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-03T12:49:05Z","email":"tprashant76640@gmail.com","name":"prashanttiw"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-03T12:49:05Z","email":"tprashant76640@gmail.com","name":"prashanttiw"},"message":"fix(admin): wire AdminSettings/AdminUsers to read/write page-access; canWrite guards on Leads kanban\n\nAdminSettingsPage:\n- Pages access editor now sends pageKey => ''read''|''write'' map instead of a flat\n  string array; toggle switches show separate Read / Write radio options per page\n- Super-logs and security pages now appear in the access grant UI\n- Reflects the new AdminPageAccessService.PAGE_PERMISSION_MAP structure\n\nAdminUsers:\n- pages column renders per-page access level badges (Read / Write) instead of\n  a plain list of page names\n- updateAdminUser call passes Record<string,PageAccessLevel> matching the new\n  api.ts type; removes the Number() cast and string[] assumption\n- User directory role filter defaults to ''agent''; admin/super_admin options only\n  shown when canManageUsers is true (prevents leaking admin roster to limited admins)\n\nAdminDashboardPage:\n- user role filter defaults to ''agent'' (not '''') so initial load never triggers\n  the user_management.view RBAC gate for limited admins\n- canUseSection for ''users'' now checks canManageUsers || canViewAgentDirectory\n- resolveSection: removed /portal/admin/roles → ''users'' mapping (roles page\n  deleted)\n\nAdminLeadsPage:\n- SortableLeadCard receives canWrite prop; drag handle disabled and cursor\n  stays default when user is read-only\n- usePermission(''leads'',''edit'') determines canWrite","tree":{"sha":"2b4a1eac3a376540119b28737292522596c57349","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/trees/2b4a1eac3a376540119b28737292522596c57349"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/commits/9c1783afb8633bc87001b7ccec561acf0f29ecd9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115913516?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prashanttiw","id":115913516,"login":"prashanttiw","node_id":"U_kgDOBuizLA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/commit/9c1783afb8633bc87001b7ccec561acf0f29ecd9","node_id":"C_kwDOSnGKsNoAKDljMTc4M2FmYjg2MzNiYzg3MDAxYjdjY2VjNTYxYWNmMGYyOWVjZDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/commit/dcbb4fa63305ec8f6104bc8599da14d9c768dec6","sha":"dcbb4fa63305ec8f6104bc8599da14d9c768dec6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/commits/dcbb4fa63305ec8f6104bc8599da14d9c768dec6"}],"sha":"9c1783afb8633bc87001b7ccec561acf0f29ecd9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/commits/9c1783afb8633bc87001b7ccec561acf0f29ecd9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115913516?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prashanttiw","id":115913516,"login":"prashanttiw","node_id":"U_kgDOBuizLA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/commits/dcbb4fa63305ec8f6104bc8599da14d9c768dec6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-03T12:48:33Z","email":"tprashant76640@gmail.com","name":"prashanttiw"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-03T12:48:33Z","email":"tprashant76640@gmail.com","name":"prashanttiw"},"message":"feat(frontend): AdminSuperLogsPage + AgentLogsPage; refactor AdminLogs + AdminSecurity pages\n\nAdminLogsPage:\n- Simplified to show only the authenticated admin''s own actions (matches new\n  adminList() backend split); removed the obsolete actor_type filter that was\n  trying to show other people''s logs\n- Uses shared ActivityLogTable component; debounced log_action + target_type +\n  date filters\n\nAdminSuperLogsPage (NEW):\n- System-wide activity log page gated by activity_logs.view_all permission\n- Full filter set: actor_type, log_action, target_type, date range\n- Shows actor name, role badge, before/after value diff where present\n- Uses ActivityLogTable component\n\nAgentLogsPage (NEW):\n- Agent subtree activity log — agents see their own actions plus their direct\n  sub-agents'' actions based on tier\n- Filters: log_action, target_type, date range\n- Uses ActivityLogTable component\n\nAdminSecurityPage:\n- Complete rewrite: was a stub with hardcoded demo data\n- Now queries GET /admin/security-events with full pagination\n- Filters: event_type, date_from, date_to, identifier search\n- Event rows show actor_name (redacted if viewer lacks the role''s view perm),\n  actor_role badge, details JSON expandable, IP address\n- Stat cards: failed logins today, rate-limit hits, OTP brute force events,\n  file integrity failures\n\nActivityLogTable (new shared component):\n- Reusable paginated table for activity log entries\n- Renders label (plain-English sentence), icon (Lucide), time_ago, actor badge,\n  target_display; expandable before/after value diff row","tree":{"sha":"4ff3313f21a46f1718fb3cd5bd9d38ecf0e0cb1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/trees/4ff3313f21a46f1718fb3cd5bd9d38ecf0e0cb1a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/commits/dcbb4fa63305ec8f6104bc8599da14d9c768dec6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115913516?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/gists{/gist_id}","gravat