/api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/commits/c564c8296295b8e598294a094e58bdf9864f326c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-03T12:18:26Z","email":"tprashant76640@gmail.com","name":"prashanttiw"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-03T12:18:26Z","email":"tprashant76640@gmail.com","name":"prashanttiw"},"message":"feat(frontend): wire AdminCourses + AdminIntakes to flat paginated endpoints; add Pagination\n\nAdminCoursesPage:\n- Replaced N+1 fan-out (one fetch per university then per course) with single\n  fetchAdminCoursesAll() call — eliminates the rate-limit errors seen at scale\n- Server-side pagination with Pagination component (per_page=20)\n- Debounced search query + university filter sent as request params, not\n  client-side array filter\n- Universities picker uses a single lightweight fetchAdminUniversitiesLive()\n  call (perPage=250) instead of the previous full batch\n- canWrite gate (usePermission) hides add/edit/delete controls from read-only admins\n\nAdminIntakesPage:\n- Same pattern: replaced per-university/per-course drill-down with single\n  fetchAdminIntakesAll(); server-side q + university_id + course_id + status filters\n- Server-side pagination with Pagination component\n\nAdminUniversitiesPage:\n- ?q= search now sent to server (previously local filter)\n- Row click navigates to university detail page\n\nAdminUniversityDetailPage:\n- campus list section added; sibling universities count displayed\n\nUniversityBrowse (shared component):\n- Accepts onFilterChange callback for URL-sync; debounces search\n- Uses fetchAdminCoursesAll rather than per-university lookup\n\nPagination (new shared UI component):\n- First / Prev / Next / Last with page indicator; accessible button states","tree":{"sha":"f09ccafd575ff5b7cb3f694ee274745cf82028ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/trees/f09ccafd575ff5b7cb3f694ee274745cf82028ff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/commits/c564c8296295b8e598294a094e58bdf9864f326c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115913516?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prashanttiw","id":115913516,"login":"prashanttiw","node_id":"U_kgDOBuizLA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/commit/c564c8296295b8e598294a094e58bdf9864f326c","node_id":"C_kwDOSnGKsNoAKGM1NjRjODI5NjI5NWI4ZTU5ODI5NGEwOTRlNThiZGY5ODY0ZjMyNmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/commit/4ce39cf3f4794ef756812bd36ddc6626aa67cbd9","sha":"4ce39cf3f4794ef756812bd36ddc6626aa67cbd9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/commits/4ce39cf3f4794ef756812bd36ddc6626aa67cbd9"}],"sha":"c564c8296295b8e598294a094e58bdf9864f326c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/commits/c564c8296295b8e598294a094e58bdf9864f326c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115913516?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prashanttiw","id":115913516,"login":"prashanttiw","node_id":"U_kgDOBuizLA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/commits/4ce39cf3f4794ef756812bd36ddc6626aa67cbd9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-03T12:17:56Z","email":"tprashant76640@gmail.com","name":"prashanttiw"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-03T12:17:56Z","email":"tprashant76640@gmail.com","name":"prashanttiw"},"message":"fix(api): typed activity log helpers; fetchSuperActivityLogs + fetchAgentActivityLogs; catalog + RBAC updates\n\nActivity logs:\n- New ActivityLogEntry interface with all fields (id, actor_*, action, target_*,\n  before_value, after_value, ip_address, user_agent, created_at, label, icon, time_ago)\n- New ActivityLogParams interface; buildActivityLogQuery() shared builder\n- fetchAdminActivityLogs() now typed and uses ActivityLogParams (breaking rename:\n  was accepting Record<string,any>; now sends ?log_action= instead of ?action=\n  to avoid collision with the route dispatching convention)\n- fetchSuperActivityLogs(): NEW — system-wide log via /admin/super-activity-logs\n- fetchAgentActivityLogs(): NEW — subtree log via /agent/activity-logs\n\nRBAC / user management:\n- AdminPermissionSummary gains canViewAgentDirectory (split from canManageUsers)\n- AdminUserSummary.pages type changed from string[] to Record<string,PageAccessLevel>\n- updateAdminUser pages payload similarly changed\n- PageAccessLevel type exported (''read'' | ''write'')\n\nCatalog:\n- fetchAdminCoursesAll(): NEW — calls /admin/courses with q/perPage/page/\n  universityId/degreeLevel params\n- fetchAdminIntakesAll(): NEW — calls /admin/intakes with equivalent params\n- fetchAdminUniversitiesLive() gains ?q= support\n- CatalogUniversity gains siblingCount field","tree":{"sha":"bdb2b19bd542f53bf89a5ecc4e250613d31d42d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/trees/bdb2b19bd542f53bf89a5ecc4e250613d31d42d0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/commits/4ce39cf3f4794ef756812bd36ddc6626aa67cbd9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115913516?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prashanttiw","id":115913516,"login":"prashanttiw","node_id":"U_kgDOBuizLA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://a