prashanttiw"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-03T12:17:31Z","email":"tprashant76640@gmail.com","name":"prashanttiw"},"message":"fix(system-settings): remove 5 dead settings that no backend code ever reads\n\nMigration 079 deletes the following system_settings rows:\n- otp_max_attempts: OTPService::verify() hardcodes maxAttempts=3 in every\n  call; the DB value was never read\n- commission_pending_alert_days: no cron or service queries this setting\n  to fire commission age reminders\n- reminder_days_before_deadline: ReminderService takes offsets as a parameter;\n  the only caller (PaymentTrackingController) hardcodes its own offsets\n- api_log_slow_threshold_ms: the api_request_logs table this would gate is\n  never written to by any code path\n- argon2_memory_cost / argon2_time_cost: password_hash() calls read\n  ARGON2_MEMORY_COST/ARGON2_TIME_COST from crm-api/.env via Environment::get,\n  never from system_settings\n\nschema.sql and setup_database.php updated to not seed these rows on fresh\ninstalls; all_migrations_combined.sql updated with the migration 079 note.\nstorage/cache/settings.json rebuilt to reflect the cleaned-up settings set.","tree":{"sha":"8d11d556348f9874c79f5127bb61615505be705d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/trees/8d11d556348f9874c79f5127bb61615505be705d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/commits/23af6ff4862b07509346bc5a7ee2ad1ec64ff254","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115913516?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://