tiw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/commits/6cf7ccaed841ece8028e4be6cab6184415dd80f4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-03T12:17:01Z","email":"tprashant76640@gmail.com","name":"prashanttiw"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-03T12:17:01Z","email":"tprashant76640@gmail.com","name":"prashanttiw"},"message":"feat(catalog): university campus schema, bulk import helpers, city/country validator\n\nMigrations:\n- 077_university_campuses: new university_campuses table — each university row\n  can now have N campus records (city, is_primary flag) instead of a single\n  universities.city string; FK cascade delete; indexed on university_id\n- 078_university_campus_groups: groups universities that share a physical campus\n  location (e.g. multiple international programs on the same site) for dedup\n  and ''also at this campus'' suggestions\n\nDB utilities (CLI/admin scripts, not web-accessible):\n- import_universities_from_toolkit.php: bulk importer from a CSV/JSON toolkit\n  export into universities + university_campuses in a single transaction\n- promote_university_campuses.php: migrates existing universities.city (single\n  value) into university_campuses rows with is_primary=1, safe to run once\n- campus_city_country_overrides.php: curated override map for city/country\n  corrections needed post-import (e.g. ''Wien'' → ''Vienna'', ''Österreich'' → ''Austria'')\n\nHelpers:\n- CampusCityValidator: validates and normalises city/country strings during\n  import; uses override map; flags rows that need manual review","tree":{"sha":"f1810a85f279a7bb973c02d5b4b76aacafd40db5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/trees/f1810a85f279a7bb973c02d5b4b76aacafd40db5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/