l":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prashanttiw","id":115913516,"login":"prashanttiw","node_id":"U_kgDOBuizLA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/commits/94a0da7f01f6e9bca5b318e925b272c76059c1f4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-03T12:16:32Z","email":"tprashant76640@gmail.com","name":"prashanttiw"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-03T12:16:32Z","email":"tprashant76640@gmail.com","name":"prashanttiw"},"message":"feat(catalog): add flat paginated course + intake list endpoints; fix N+1 fan-out\n\nCourseController::adminListAll() (NEW):\n- GET /admin/courses — flat paginated list across ALL universities in one query\n  instead of fanning out one request per university then per course\n- Supports ?q= (full-text match on course name / university name), ?university_id=,\n  ?degree_level= filters\n- Returns university_public_id, university_name, university_logo_file_id per row\n- Fixes the ''too many requests / rate limit'' error that appeared once the catalog\n  reached 2,600+ courses (N+1 made hundreds of sequential HTTP calls)\n\nIntakeController::adminListAll() (NEW):\n- GET /admin/intakes — same flat paginated approach across all courses/universities\n- Supports ?q=, ?university_id=, ?course_id=, ?status= filters\n- Includes application_count aggregate per intake row (avoids separate lookups)\n- Returns course_public_id, course_name, university_public_id, university_name\n\nUniversityController (admin list):\n- Added ?q= search filter on name/country/city (admin side, not just public catalog)\n\nUniversityModel:\n- findByPublicId() now also returns sibling_count (other universities in same\n  country) useful for related university suggestions on detail pages\n\nUniversityRoutes:\n- Registers GET /admin/courses (adminListAll) and GET /admin/intakes (adminListAll)","tree":{"sha":"9d8267c82035b20cead39c66d527d859bc58dc07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/trees/9d8267c82035b20cead39c66d527d859bc58dc07"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/commits/94a0da7f01f6e9bca5b318e925b272c76059c1f4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115913516?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prashanttiw","id":115913516,"login":"prashanttiw","node_id":"U_kgDOBuizLA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenue