.view; fix canManageUsers split; remove RoleController\n\nAdminDashboardController:\n- getUsers(): the admin roster path (no role filter / role=admin / super_admin)\n  now enforces RBACMiddleware::requirePermission(''user_management'', ''view'')\n  before returning decrypted emails, phones, and page grants; without this any\n  authenticated admin with zero grants could list every other admin''s PII\n- updateUser(): adds RBACMiddleware::requirePermission(''user_management'',''edit'')\n  guard — previously unprotected\n- permissions.canManageUsers: now maps to user_management.view (not a loose OR\n  of multiple permission strings) to match the new RBAC gate above\n- permissions.canViewAgentDirectory: new — allows an admin without\n  user_management.view to still see the agents-only tab in the Users section\n- user role filter now defaults to ''agent'' (not '''') so the initial widget load\n  never triggers the admin-roster RBAC gate for admins who lack user_management\n- Admin user-directory dropdown hides admin/super_admin/counsellor/visa_officer\n  options from callers that lack canManageUsers\n- AdminPageAccessService::resolveAccessLevels used instead of inline loop for\n  resolving page keys from a permission-key GROUP_CONCAT in getUsers()\n\nRoleController deleted: Role CRUD was dead code — no frontend page used it and\n  the API routes were removed in a previous commit; role management is now\n  handled entirely through AdminPageAccessService page-access assignments","tree":{"sha":"ac41c3b0a53da612177c16f891397e607263ced1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/trees/ac41c3b0a53da612177c16f891397e607263ced1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/commits/5f1656ebe30434f79d3d4124d881e08f9821ff0f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115913516?v=4","events_url":"