rashanttiw","node_id":"U_kgDOBuizLA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/commits/ba39fc837673aba8211aaa8f5cd774043759a42e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-03T12:15:26Z","email":"tprashant76640@gmail.com","name":"prashanttiw"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-03T12:15:26Z","email":"tprashant76640@gmail.com","name":"prashanttiw"},"message":"feat(rbac): read/write page-access levels; super_logs + security pages; actor redaction\n\nAdminPageAccessService:\n- PAGE_PERMISSION_MAP restructured from flat list → {view: [...], write: [...]}\n  buckets per page; granting ''read'' now issues only view permissions,\n  granting ''write'' issues view + all write permissions\n- New pages: super_logs (view: activity_logs.view_all) and security\n  (view: security_events.view) — previously there was no way to grant an\n  admin just these two pages\n- sanitizePageAccess(): validates + normalises raw request payload into\n  pageKey => ''read''|''write'' map; unknown keys dropped, anything ≠ ''write''\n  treated as ''read''\n- apply() updated to honour access levels and call sanitizePageAccess\n- resolveAccess() NEW: returns pageKey => ''read''|''write'' for a given admin\n- resolveAccessLevels() NEW public pure mapper: derives access-level map from\n  a flat permission-key list without a DB round-trip\n- AdminDashboardController::updateUser() now calls sanitizePageAccess before\n  AdminPageAccessService::apply, rejecting unknown page keys\n\nAdminRoutes:\n- Added GET admin/super-activity-logs → ActivityLogController::superList\n- Removed RoleController routes (role management folded into page-access)\n\nSecurityEventController:\n- Resolves actor_name (student/agent/admin full_name) via JOIN and includes\n  actor_role in every event row\n- Applies per-viewer permission redaction: if the viewer only has\n  security_events.view but NOT students.view, student actor names are null\n  (prevents leaking identities the viewer isn''t authorised to see)\n\nMigration 070: adds activity_logs.view_all permission row to permissions table","tree":{"sha":"bf7441835aada32c35a3321fb264ada0d8470bce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/trees/bf7441835aada32c35a3321fb264ada0d8470bce"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/commits/ba39fc837673aba8211aaa8f5cd774043759a42e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115913516?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prashanttiw","id":115913516,"login":"prashanttiw","node_id":"U_kgDOBuizLA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/commit/ba39fc837673aba8211aaa8f5cd774043759a42e","node_id":"C_kwDOSnGKsNoAKGJhMzlmYzgzNzY3M2FiYTgyMTFhYWE4ZjVjZDc3NDA0Mzc1OWE0MmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/commit/ee4ae96b260e86f6a4d2f8617ab9864d5b8a83b6","sha":"ee4ae96b260e86f6a4d2f8617ab9864d5b8a83b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/commits/ee4ae96b260e86f6a4d2f8617ab9864d5b8a83b6"}],"sha":"ba39fc837673aba8211aaa8f5cd774043759a42e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/commits/ba39fc837673aba8211aaa8f5cd774043759a42e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115913516?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prashanttiw","id":115913516,"login":"prashanttiw","node_id":"U_kgDOBuizLA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/commits/ee4ae96b260e86f6a4d2f8617ab9864d5b8a83b6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-03T12:14:52Z","email":"tprashant76640@gmail.com","name":"prashanttiw"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-03T12:14:52Z","email":"tprashant76640@gmail.com","name":"prashanttiw"},"message":"feat(logs): split activity log into own-actions + super-log; add agent log endpoint\n\nActivityLogController:\n- adminList(): now shows ONLY the authenticated admin''s own actions — no\n  RBAC permission required beyond being logged in as admin (every admin can\n  see what they themselves did); removes the old view-all default\n- superList(): NEW — system-wide log across all actor types, gated by\n  activity_logs.view_all permission (super admins bypass via RBACMiddleware)\n- agentList(): NEW — shows actions by the agent''s tier-aware subtree\n  (uses AgentHierarchy::subtreeUserIds); supports ?log_action=, ?target_type=,\n  ?date_from=, ?date_to= filters\n- Both list and superList use shared respondWithLogs() / buildFilterClause()\n  helpers; all rows include label/icon/time_ago from ActivityLabelFormatter\n- Drops before-value from the feed; before_value now included for diff display\n\nActivityFeedController:\n- Admin feed: own actions only by default; callers with activity_logs.view_all\n  get full system feed\n- Agent feed: uses AgentHierarchy::subtreeUserIds (replaces inline fan-out)\n- All formatting delegated to ActivityLabelFormatter (removes ~60 lines of\n  inline match/string-building code from the controller)\n- before_value now included in feed rows for future diff display","tree":{"sha":"7d26170536636e35dfc44a8b3d0ea4d21af809cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/trees/7d26170536636e35dfc44a8b3d0ea4d21af809cd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/commits/ee4ae96b260e86f6a4d2f8617ab9864d5b8a83b6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115913516?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/following{/other_user}","gis