hub.com/users/prashanttiw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/commits/6e4ab2bfdd2919699999d0488574e278de2e7c11/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-03T12:14:24Z","email":"tprashant76640@gmail.com","name":"prashanttiw"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-03T12:14:24Z","email":"tprashant76640@gmail.com","name":"prashanttiw"},"message":"refactor(activity): extract ActivityLabelFormatter + AgentHierarchy helpers\n\nActivityLabelFormatter (new Helpers class):\n- Consolidates formatAction(), getIcon(), timeAgo() that were previously\n  duplicated inside ActivityFeedController; now shared by ActivityFeedController\n  and ActivityLogController\n- icon() covers 20+ action types (student.*, agent.*, application.*,\n  lead.*, document_request.*, commission.*, notice.*, system_setting.*)\n- label() builds a human-readable sentence from the action + context row,\n  including before→after value diffing for system_setting.changed\n\nAgentHierarchy (new Helpers class):\n- subtreeUserIds(PDO, int agentUserId): resolves the tier-aware set of\n  user_ids reachable from a given agent — root sees full subtree, sub-agent\n  sees itself + direct children, leaf sees itself only\n- Extracted from ActivityFeedController and reused by ActivityLogController\n  and AgentList; replaces two independent copies of the same manual SQL fan-out\n\nActivityLogger (service):\n- Adds target_display and actor_display_name fields so logs show human-readable\n  names without an extra JOIN at query time","tree":{"sha":"6c6711a67e776ad86a6263238144c017f79c6f26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/trees/6c6711a67e776ad86a6263238144c017f79c6f26"