eset_completed\n- verifyAdminOtpLogin() login_failed / login_success\nAll events now include the reason key (e.g. unknown_email, wrong_password,\ninvalid_otp) in the details JSON so the Security page shows actionable context.\n\nOTPService:\n- verify() otp_not_found / otp_brute_force events now use SecurityEventLogger\n  instead of an ad-hoc prepared statement\n\nFileController:\n- download() file_integrity_failure now uses SecurityEventLogger; also fixes\n  the userId variable to be cast to (int) for correct type in the log","tree":{"sha":"2c089555d6082a42ffb8e7f1469edbdd4d6e0f71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/trees/2c089555d6082a42ffb8e7f1469edbdd4d6e0f71"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/git/commits/ac75d2f0a6650929403f5919b8989d987d74c9ef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115913516?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prashanttiw","id":115913516,"login":"prashanttiw","node_id":"U_kgDOBuizLA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prashanttiw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/prashanttiw/TheGlobalAvenues-CRM/commit/ac75d2f0a6650