d52b5c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T23:10:44Z","email":"paalamugan@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Paalamugan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T23:10:44Z","email":"paalamugan@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Paalamugan"},"message":"fix(components): reorder data-starting/ending-style class modifiers\n\nPrettier''s tailwindcss class sorter expects data-state variants to come\nafter responsive/state modifiers, not before. The previous commit\n(852d6e9) added data-starting-style / data-ending-style variants in the\nwrong position in the cn() class strings, which the linter caught as\n5 warnings under --max-warnings 0.\n\nReorders:\n- Accordion: ending-style → starting-style (h-0 modifier order)\n- NavigationMenu (×2): starting-style / ending-style moved after motion\n  + viewport classes\n- Sheet (×2): starting-style / ending-style moved after\n  data-[side=*] modifiers + responsive prefixes\n\nNo semantic change — pure class-string ordering to match Prettier''s\ntailwindcss plugin sort order. Lint and type-check both clean.","tree":{"sha":"9ab5f835c1953d73753cbd29d24b6b25fee5bbec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paalamugan/paalstack-react-ui/git/trees/9ab5f835c1953d73753cbd29d24b6b25fee5bbec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paalamugan/paalstack-react-ui/git/commits/71bae48d58e2e7a3b6b8ad34baa5ec87a5d52b5c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42642576?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paalamugan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paalamugan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paalamugan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paalamugan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/paalamugan","id":42642576,"login":"paalamugan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyNjQyNTc2","organizations_url"