tps://api.github.com/users/paalamugan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paalamugan/paalstack-react-ui/commits/e28addeba514a4de9395430883dc0fb5e606ff9e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T22:57:31Z","email":"paalamugan@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Paalamugan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T22:57:31Z","email":"paalamugan@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Paalamugan"},"message":"fix(skills): sync per-package skill copies + add drift-detection script\n\nThe monorepo source at skills/paalstack-react-ui/ is the canonical skill\nthat ships in the npm tarballs for @paalstack/react-ui,\n@paalstack/react-hooks, and @paalstack/react-icons. The three per-package\ncopies (packages/{ui,hooks,icons}/skills/paalstack-react-ui/) had drifted\nout of sync with the source, so consumers installing only one package\ngot stale docs (wrong component count, wrong primitive framework, missing\nCSS exports, missing batched-build section).\n\nThis commit:\n\n1. Re-syncs all 3 per-package copies to match the canonical source.\n   The ui package ships all source files (SKILL.md + README.md +\n   references/ + scripts/); hooks and icons ship a smaller subset\n   (SKILL.md + references/component-inventory.md).\n\n2. Adds scripts/sync-skills.mjs with --check (CI) and --sync (manual)\n   modes. Wired into:\n   - pnpm skills:sync    (manual full sync)\n   - pnpm lint:skills    (CI drift check, exit 1 on drift)\n   - .github/workflows/ci.yml lint job\n\n3. Adds a changeset (patch bump for all 3 packages) documenting the sync.\n\nThe skill documents 76 components on Base UI primitives (was ''61+ on\nRadix UI''), 73 hooks (was ''50+''), all 9 CSS subpaths (was 4), the\npackages/ui batched-build section, the refined shadow scale, and usage\nexamples for every component, hook, and icon pack.","tree":{"sha":"8358428e6d029fc07a5ab4aba9dacdaac56fbd4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paalamugan/paalstack-react-ui/git/trees/8358428e6d029fc07a5ab4aba9dacdaac56fbd4c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paalamugan/paalstack-react-ui/git/commits/e28addeba514a4de9395430883dc0fb5e606ff9e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42642576?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paalamugan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paalamugan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paalamugan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paalamugan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/paalamugan","id":42642576,"login":"paalamugan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyNjQyNTc2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paalamugan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paalamugan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paalamugan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paalamugan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paalamugan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/paalamugan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/paalamugan/paalstack-react-ui/commit/e28addeba514a4de9395430883dc0fb5e606ff9e","node_id":"C_kwDOSnYLvNoAKGUyOGFkZGViYTUxNGE0ZGU5Mzk1NDMwODgzZGMwZmI1ZTYwNmZmOWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/paalamugan/paalstack-react-ui/commit/faab3adb4c7beb7f28f558d30033f38f8642ba12","sha":"faab3adb4c7beb7f28f558d30033f38f8642ba12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paalamugan/paalstack-react-ui/commits/faab3adb4c7beb7f28f558d30033f38f8642ba12"}],"sha":"e28addeba514a4de9395430883dc0fb5e606ff9e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paalamugan/paalstack-react-ui/commits/e28addeba514a4de9395430883dc0fb5e606ff9e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42642576?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paalamugan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paalamugan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paalamugan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paalamugan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/paalamugan","id":42642576,"login":"paalamugan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyNjQyNTc2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paalamugan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paalamugan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paalamugan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paalamugan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paalamugan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/paalamugan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paalamugan/paalstack-react-ui/commits/faab3adb4c7beb7f28f558d30033f38f8642ba12/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T22:51:28Z","email":"paalamugan@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Paalamugan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T22:51:28Z","email":"paalamugan@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Paalamugan"},"message":"docs: refresh CSS exports, batched build, counts, and component inventory\n\nAdopt the new all.css single-import shortcut across all consumer-facing docs\n(README, packages/ui/README, storybook overview/getting-started, in-repo skill)\nand document the 5 new CSS subpaths (base.css, utilities.css, toast.css,\nfonts.css, all.css). Add packages/ui batched build commands alongside the\nexisting components script in both the top-level README and both skills.\n\nFix factual drift surfaced by this audit:\n- components.mdx: 61+ → 76 components; Radix UI primitives → Base UI primitives\n  (the library uses @base-ui/react, not @radix-ui/*)\n- hooks.mdx: 62+ → 73 hooks\n- packages/hooks count: 50+ → 73\n- providers count: 3 → 4 (added FormatIntlProvider)\n- Custom theme examples use all.css + show shadow token override\n\nComponent inventory (450 lines, both in-repo and downstream copies):\n- Categorized tables for all 76 components with import + props-API one-liner\n- Full 73-hook cheat sheet with usage patterns\n- All 31 icon packs with import path + naming convention\n- Shared utility examples (cn, httpClient, Intl formatters)\n- CSS exports reference (all 9 subpaths)","tree":{"sha":"d9ec51ff881f41510d89e9b8fe0f6433645f67d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paalamugan/paalstack-react-ui/git/trees/d9ec51ff881f41510d89e9b8fe0f6433645f67d9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paalamugan/paalstack-react-ui/git/commits/faab3adb4c7beb7f28f558d30033f38f8642ba12","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42642576?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paalamugan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paalamugan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paalamugan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paalamugan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/paalamugan","id":42642576,"login":"paalamugan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyNjQyNTc2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paalamugan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paalamugan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paalamugan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paalamugan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paalamugan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/paalamugan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/paalamugan/paalstack-react-ui/commit/faab3adb4c7beb7f28f558d30033f38f8642ba12","node_id":"C_kwDOSnYLvNoAKGZhYWIzYWRiNGM3YmViN2YyOGY1NThkMzAwMzNmMzhmODY0MmJhMTI","parents":[{"html_