bar + 6 shadcn components with props APIs\n\nNew components ported to paalstack standard (Base UI, cn, data-slot+data-qa,\n@/icons/lu), each with Storybook stories:\n- Sidebar (25 sub-components, mobile Sheet, cmd+B toggle, cookie persistence)\n- Attachment (upload states, horizontal/vertical, groups)\n- Bubble (7 variants, reactions) + Message (chat layout primitives)\n- MessageScroller (auto-scroll chat viewport) + Questionnaire (multi-step forms)\n- Marker (message list separators/timestamps)\n\nProps APIs added per the two-API convention:\n- Chart: config, showTooltip, showLegend, tooltipContent, legendContent\n- Direction: direction wrapper around DirectionProvider\n- MessageScrollerChat: messages array, autoScroll, emptyState\n- Questionnaire: questions, showProgress, showActions, labels (backward compat)\n\nFileUpload''s Direction type renamed to FileUploadDirection to resolve the\nbarrel collision with the new Direction component.","tree":{"sha":"e4d399c31b8a30b3ea66f0d4d3ff3ad3849b2f7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paalamugan/paalstack-react-ui/git/trees/e4d399c31b8a30b3ea66f0d4d3ff3ad3849b2f7e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paalamugan/paalstack-react-ui/git/commits/515e52d18da2834512ca257ea404fac8e5038e8b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42642576?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paalamugan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paalamugan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paalamugan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paalamugan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/paalamugan","id":42642576,"login":"paalamugan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyNjQyNTc2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paalamugan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paalamugan/received_event