oday ring, hover tooltips,\n  streak + total footer), plus LineChart and BarChart (dependency-free SVG).\n- Profile: rebuilt into a real insights dashboard — 6 stat cards\n  (streak/longest/retention/reviews/minutes/mastered), full-year activity\n  heatmap, retention-over-time line chart, per-track mastery bars.\n- Home: richer visual stat strip with a daily-goal ring (minutes vs goal),\n  streak flame, and a compact recent-activity heatmap linking to Profile.\n- Keyboard: global shortcuts (? help overlay, g h/l/e/p quick-nav),\n  upgraded ⌘K command palette (Navigation / Actions / Syllabi groups:\n  new syllabus, start session, toggle theme, show shortcuts).\n- Fix: guard Profile retention/study-minutes against missing user fields\n  (was rendering NaN%); harden the retention slider.\n\ntypecheck + build + 15 unit + 7 e2e all green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"55b01966263bb1d713a5ae14a52bdef18f259baf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whyujjwal/compound-learning/git/trees/55b01966263bb1d713a5ae14a52bdef18f259baf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whyujjwal/compound-learning/git/commits/f04da5f354ce6ca7de5c8c281c53eaebe04cab9a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138800022?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whyujjwal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whyujjwal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whyujjwal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whyujjwal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/whyujjwal","id":138800022,"login":"whyujjwal","node_id":"U_kgDOCEXrlg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whyujjwal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whyujjwal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whyujjwal/repos","sit