-grade rebuild — screens, data layer, cleanup\n\nRebuild the remaining screens on the new design system and remove the\nlegacy styling/components, completing the from-scratch Notion redesign.\n\n- Screens: Library + Studio, Explore, Profile, Session + Block, Login\n  rebuilt with Tailwind v4 tokens (light + dark), wired to the\n  OpenAPI-generated data layer (lib/hooks).\n- Remove legacy scaffolding: entire styles/ (~8.3k LOC CSS), old shell\n  (components/ui/*), old viz/primitives, lib/query/client.tsx.\n- Migrate stale tokens to the new system; fix Home/Block completed-slot\n  localStorage key mismatch.\n- Harden ActivityStrip against non-array data; restore ResourceChip\n  provider + type a11y label; add aria-label to SectionEditor remove.\n- Update unit + e2e tests to the new UI (selectors, copy, redirects);\n  add data-testid hooks. typecheck + build + 15 unit + 7 e2e green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"61d4efda7106a329d1addab43fae58047a486353","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whyujjwal/compound-learning/git/trees/61d4efda7106a329d1addab43fae58047a486353"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whyujjwal/compound-learning/git/commits/00f180d8bf109c324d96dcec2076c2fa4b5fc1d2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138800022?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whyujjwal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whyujjwal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whyujjwal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whyujjwal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/whyujjwal","id":138800022,"login":"whyujjwal","node_id":"U_kgDOCEXrlg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whyujjwal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whyujjwal/received_events","repos_url":"htt