ail.com","name":"whyujjwal"},"message":"feat: personalized AI roadmaps, per-user scheduling, and fixes\n\nDynamic roadmaps\n- Add roadmap_generator service: turns free-text goals + weekly hours into a\n  full curriculum (tracks, real internet resources, weekly schedule) via the\n  configured AI provider, with defensive JSON normalization.\n- POST /api/curriculum/generate (preview or apply); inline import supports a\n  replace/prune flag.\n- New /curriculum/build page with goals input, preview, and apply flows; wired\n  into nav, command palette, and Today/Roadmap empty states.\n\nPer-user scheduling\n- Store weekly_schedule, learning_goals, onboarded on User (migration 0004 +\n  idempotent boot-time column add).\n- Queue/HEFT planner and curriculum routes now read each user''s stored schedule\n  instead of the bundled file; new users start empty and onboard via the builder.\n\nFixes\n- Global exception handler no longer swallows HTTPExceptions as 500s.\n- Consolidate duplicate auth modules onto auth_service (delete app/auth.py).\n- Correct stale Coach system prompt (4 tracks, not 3).\n- FSRS interval logging rounds instead of truncating sub-day intervals.\n\nTests: 25 passing (added roadmap endpoint + exception-handler coverage).","tree":{"sha":"ffbc80ec603b7b48dc3d14af0544bb5da6a0f676","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whyujjwal/compound-learning/git/trees/ffbc80ec603b7b48dc3d14af0544bb5da6a0f676"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whyujjwal/compound-learning/git/commits/85911f5a7c69ff0eccc99f2b1f8baaab7be22fc0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138800022?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whyujjwal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whyujjwal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whyujjwal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whyujjwal