uest ML\n  entry and redundant MIT one-off lecture duplicates.\n- Sync curriculum on every boot with prune_orphans so prod picks up new\n  materials and drops retired playlist titles.\n\nSession UI\n- parseMaterialNotes.ts splits structured briefs into sections rendered\n  upfront on SessionCard (Watch/Do/Deliverable visible; Recall after\n  Reveal). Legacy one-line notes still show in an About panel.\n- Block timer supports pause/resume; paused time excluded from elapsed.\n  Clock persists across cards in the same block via sessionStorage.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"4f13d494e7859178e44d6a5aed31fd79a3c77bd0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whyujjwal/compound-learning/git/trees/4f13d494e7859178e44d6a5aed31fd79a3c77bd0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whyujjwal/compound-learning/git/commits/2892c40a59fba2267269260695ce4edf92ee0bd1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138800022?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whyujjwal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whyujjwal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whyujjwal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whyujjwal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/whyujjwal","id":138800022,"login":"whyujjwal","node_id":"U_kgDOCEXrlg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whyujjwal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whyujjwal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whyujjwal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whyujjwal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whyujjwal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/whyujjwal","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/whyujjwal/compound-l