oints to AGENTS.md\n- AGENTS.md: priority declaration + UI Library section (boogiepop-ui)\n- spec-kit: README updated with tool entries, stack updated with boogiepop packages\n- .gitlab-ci.yml: include platform-guards + local check-ci-integrity job\n  (dual guard: blocks PRs that touch AGENTS.md or .gitlab-ci.yml)\n- app/globals.css: imports boogiepop-ui/styles, Tailwind @theme maps bp-* tokens,\n  keeps next/font var overrides for IBM Plex Sans/Mono\n- AuthSdkPanel, AwsDemoPanel, page.tsx: st-* -> bp-* class migration\n  AuthSdkPanel: roles.map(r => r.name) for BoogiepopRole[] type\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"69a35118c5bef737f4fc7907fd2e7b07321214ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/blanck1945/boogiepop-next-seed/git/trees/69a35118c5bef737f4fc7907fd2e7b07321214ec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/blanck1945/boogiepop-next-seed/git/commits/65e08784d53c0ed7bc46ed6c260a518465b4ff8f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63178996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blanck1945/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blanck1945/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blanck1945/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blanck1945/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/blanck1945","id":63178996,"login":"blanck1945","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMTc4OTk2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blanck1945/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blanck1945/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blanck1945/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blanck1945/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blanck1945/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blanck1945","