 Add platform-change note: 2026-06-11 Plays redefined as 30s+ listen\n  (AMP standard); dashboard headline metric switched to Plays + Downloads\n- Add corresponding changelog entry (en/ja) and caveat on pre-change\n  SHOW_PLAYS semantics in graphql docs\n- Add Browser Automation page to index page tables; update endpoint counts\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b699caca7324748e178c97d63af94fccdc936fae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/higuchiki/spotify-for-creators-api/git/trees/b699caca7324748e178c97d63af94fccdc936fae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/higuchiki/spotify-for-creators-api/git/commits/370bf4113aaf24536e2fcaeeee1d810ffa7acdc2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49447994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/higuchiki/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/higuchiki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/higuchiki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/higuchiki/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/higuchiki","id":49447994,"login":"higuchiki","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5NDQ3OTk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/higuchiki/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/higuchiki/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/higuchiki/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/higuchiki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/higuchiki/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/higuchiki","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/higuchiki/spotify-for-creators-api/commit/370bf4113aaf24536e2fcaeeee1d810ffa7acdc2","node_id":"C_kwDOSnyjk9oAKDM3MGJmNDExM2FhZjI0NTM2ZTJmY2FlZWVlMWQ4MTBmZmE3YWNkYzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/higuchiki/spotify-for-creators-api/commit/0982dae0c8120d10187e2b48452eb094df75eb78","sha":"0982dae0c8120d10187e2b48452eb094df75eb78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/higuchiki/spotify-for-creators-api/commits/0982dae0c8120d10187e2b48452eb094df75eb78"}],"sha":"370bf4113aaf24536e2fcaeeee1d810ffa7acdc2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/higuchiki/spotify-for-creators-api/commits/370bf4113aaf24536e2fcaeeee1d810ffa7acdc2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49447994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/higuchiki/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/higuchiki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/higuchiki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/higuchiki/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/higuchiki","id":49447994,"login":"higuchiki","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5NDQ3OTk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/higuchiki/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/higuchiki/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/higuchiki/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/higuchiki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/higuchiki/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/higuchiki","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/higuchiki/spotify-for-creators-api/commits/0982dae0c8120d10187e2b48452eb094df75eb78/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-12T08:44:01Z","email":"higuchi.kiyonori@gmail.com","name":"higuchiki"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-12T08:44:01Z","email":"higuchi.kiyonori@gmail.com","name":"higuchiki"},"message":"docs: add Jun 2026 engagement/audience/benchmark/AI-insight queries\n\nExtracted GraphQL ASTs from the S4C analytics microfrontend JS bundle\n(microfrontend-analytics-cdn.spotifycdn.com) on 2026-06-12 to document\n15 new operations and 30+ new enum values.\n\nNew operations:\n- Engagement tab: getEngagementStats, getEngagementStatsNRT,\n  getShowRetention, getEpisodeCompletionRates, getEpisodeTimeSeriesByMetric\n- Audience growth (core fan model): getAudienceGrowthTimeSeries,\n  getAudienceGrowthMetricSummary, getAudienceGrowthInsights\n- Benchmark: getBenchmarkTotal, getBenchmarkTimeSeries\n- Overview tab: getShowStreamsAndDownloadsDaily, getShowTopEpisodesByMetric,\n  getShowTopEpisodesByImpressions, getPerformanceStats, getPerformanceStatsNRT\n- Named ops confirmed: getShowSegmentedAudienceTotal,\n  getShowSegmentedAudienceTimeSeries, getShowDiscoveryFunnelStats\n- AI Insights: generateAnalyticsInsight, getAnalyticsInsight,\n  submitAnalyticsInsightFeedback\n\nNew types: ConsumptionValue, AverageConsumptionTimeValue,\nBenchmarkTimeSeriesValue, TopEpisodesFacetedValue\n\nNew enums: SHOW_CONSUMPTION, SHOW_AVERAGE_CONSUMPTION_TIME, SHOW_RETENTION,\nSHOW_BENCHMARK_EPISODE, SHOW_STREAMS_AND_DOWNLOADS_BY_APP (+7 more),\nEPISODE_AVERAGE_COMPLETION_RATE (+12 more), WINDOW_FIRST_SEVEN_DAYS (+5 more),\nBenchmarkMetricType (13 values), BenchmarkEpisodePool (2 values)\n\nCorrected: DiscoveryFunnelStep.stepValue is a union type (CountValueLong /\nRatioValueFloat), not a plain `value` field.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a3408b557dfd2f0133a59669025c49c713f900b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/higuchiki/spotify-for-creators-api/git/trees/a3408b557dfd2f0133a59669025c49c713f900b9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/higuchiki/spotify-for-creators-api/git/commits/0982dae0c8120d10187e2b48452eb094df75eb78","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49447994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/higuchiki/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/higuchiki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/user