e-cdshooks/commit/7eb7976f27e2d8e6c05c56d4449c6e94243fb54d","node_id":"C_kwDOSn6E69oAKDdlYjc5NzZmMjdlMmQ4ZTZjMDVjNTZkNDQ0OWM2ZTk0MjQzZmI1NGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jajjer/openmrs-module-cdshooks/commit/756953c59449840d684c152504d9bdd4b488a83d","sha":"756953c59449840d684c152504d9bdd4b488a83d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jajjer/openmrs-module-cdshooks/commits/756953c59449840d684c152504d9bdd4b488a83d"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/jajjer/openmrs-module-cdshooks/commit/ca2a613c0702fdbeb65827903c6e177ed6946e55","sha":"ca2a613c0702fdbeb65827903c6e177ed6946e55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jajjer/openmrs-module-cdshooks/commits/ca2a613c0702fdbeb65827903c6e177ed6946e55"}],"sha":"7eb7976f27e2d8e6c05c56d4449c6e94243fb54d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jajjer/openmrs-module-cdshooks/commits/7eb7976f27e2d8e6c05c56d4449c6e94243fb54d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74619832?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jajjer","id":74619832,"login":"jajjer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0NjE5ODMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jajjer/openmrs-module-cdshooks/commits/ca2a613c0702fdbeb65827903c6e177ed6946e55/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-17T03:40:23Z","email":"jaj.jacob.jensen@gmail.com","name":"Jacob Jensen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-17T03:40:23Z","email":"jaj.jacob.jensen@gmail.com","name":"Jacob Jensen"},"message":"test(terminology): data-driven subsumption coverage over full reference-map datasets\n\nExercise ConceptReferenceTermMapBackend against every edge in the curated\ndev/exports datasets instead of the single hardcoded amoxicillin fixture:\n\n- rxclass_drug_class_edges.csv: 140 RxNORM ingredient -> RxClass class edges\n  (124 meds across 26 classes)\n- concept_reference_term_map_refapp3.csv: the 100-node ATC class tree plus\n  RxNORM -> ATC ingredient edges\n\n294 edges total are loaded into an in-memory term graph behind a stubbed\nConceptService (no DB), and the real subsumes() walk is asserted to:\n  1. subsume the narrower code from the broader one, for every edge\n  2. never report SUBSUMES in the reverse direction\n  3. climb multi-hop trees from leaf to root (e.g. amoxicillin -> J01CA ->\n     J01C -> ... -> J)\n  4. return EQUIVALENT for a self-map and UNKNOWN for an absent code\n\nRuns in the default `mvn test` unit harness (unlike the excluded\n*IntegrationTest classes). Verifies graph-walk mechanics over the whole\ndataset, not clinical correctness of the edges.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"656cdd7d4e3833be7560b548d78f9bd93790142c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jajjer/openmrs-module-cdshooks/git/trees/656cdd7d4e3833be7560b548d78f9bd93790142c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jajjer/openmrs-module-cdshooks/git/commits/ca2a613c0702fdbeb65827903c6e177ed6946e55","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74619832?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/followi