t per RxClass it is \"Sulfonamide Antibacterial\". The\nreal penicillin EPC is N0000175497. Corrects the test fixtures and docs that\nmapped amoxicillin to the wrong class. (The dev/exports snapshot CSVs keep the\noriginal codes — they are faithful data records, with the discrepancy explained\nin the README.)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0622ca05fa2ce69e31cecaa5e8165847840b5621","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jajjer/openmrs-module-cdshooks/git/trees/0622ca05fa2ce69e31cecaa5e8165847840b5621"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jajjer/openmrs-module-cdshooks/git/commits/e2d546d0d91076703c1592b3a867025b42eb8c7d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74619832?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jajjer","id":74619832,"login":"jajjer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0NjE5ODMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jajjer/openmrs-module-cdshooks/commit/e2d546d0d91076703c1592b3a867025b42eb8c7d","node_id":"C_kwDOSn6E69oAKGUyZDU0NmQwZDkxMDc2NzAzYzE1OTJiM2E4NjcwMjViNDJlYjhjN2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jajjer/openmrs-module-cdshooks/commit/a2d77054e8e08def065ddc00a4223