com","name":"Jacob Jensen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-16T02:46:52Z","email":"jaj.jacob.jensen@gmail.com","name":"Jacob Jensen"},"message":"fix(qa): require authentication for CDS-Hooks invocation\n\nPOST /ws/cds-services/{id} returned patient allergy cards with no auth.\nThe ForwardingFilter only authenticates Bearer tokens; the documented\nsession-cookie/basic fallback had no enforcement point, and\nCdsHooksServiceImpl self-grants read privileges, so an anonymous caller\nwho knows a patient UUID could enumerate recorded allergies by probing\ndrug codes. Gate doPost on an authenticated context; discovery (GET)\nstays public per the CDS-Hooks spec. The check is behind a package-private\nisAuthenticated() seam so it can be unit-tested without an OpenMRS context.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"91cdb274c42fb7c360b882ea7db6ea764f7462d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jajjer/openmrs-module-cdshooks/git/trees/91cdb274c42fb7c360b882ea7db6ea764f7462d8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jajjer/openmrs-module-cdshooks/git/commits/cffc4507b004fb14c5c0122e53352c18aff7af01","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74619832?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jajjer","id":74619832,"login":"jajjer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0NjE5ODMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/sta