ggerTest used Stream.toList(), added in Java 16, but the\nproject targets Java 11 and CI compiles on JDK 11 — so testCompile\nfailed there. It slipped through locally because the dev JDK is 17.\n\nThis was masked until now: earlier CI runs failed first on the\nintegration test''s compile error (fixed in #4), and javac stopped\nbefore attributing this call.\n\nVerified with mvn clean install (BUILD SUCCESS). A grep of the tree\nconfirms no other post-Java-11 stdlib APIs or language features remain.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"be1ee39acb5ab551173003228f672def8e3f0449","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jajjer/openmrs-module-cdshooks/git/trees/be1ee39acb5ab551173003228f672def8e3f0449"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jajjer/openmrs-module-cdshooks/git/commits/70d2b4983289ec454a0326b87deb87d906074f8c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74619832?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jajjer","id":74619832,"login":"jajjer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0NjE5ODMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jajjer/openmrs-module-cdshooks/commit/70d2b4983289ec454a0326b87deb87d906074f8c",