dev/ and document them in the README\n- Rename SPIKE_JOURNAL.md -> docs/IMPLEMENTATION_NOTES.md, keeping the\n  contributor gotchas and correcting now-stale \"not done\" claims (the\n  /ws/cds-services URL, CSRF exemption, bearer auth, and frontend extension\n  all exist now)\n- DESIGN.md: replace the stale single-$subsumes algorithm sketch with the real\n  cross-hierarchy traversal; add the canonical-SNOMED-frame open question\n- Fix the README module-structure tree to match the actual source layout\n- Scrub \"spike\" from source/test comments and repoint links to deleted files\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"44718c8e0cee2661d127223cae710df86dd1d54e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jajjer/openmrs-module-cdshooks/git/trees/44718c8e0cee2661d127223cae710df86dd1d54e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jajjer/openmrs-module-cdshooks/git/commits/e2fd14785c551d2806c62e124f8847dbe10e4e45","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74619832?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jajjer","id":74619832,"login":"jajjer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0NjE5ODMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.c