,"id":74619832,"login":"jajjer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0NjE5ODMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jajjer/openmrs-module-cdshooks/commits/b929b8293569304f305f1f288eb83e7b5a73af86/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-14T05:30:18Z","email":"jaj.jacob.jensen@gmail.com","name":"jajjer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-14T05:30:18Z","email":"jaj.jacob.jensen@gmail.com","name":"jajjer"},"message":"Add concept_reference_term_map terminology backend (RxClass NUI/CUI)\n\nAdds a local reference-map source for the drug-allergy matcher''s\nparent-child / subsumption lookups, per Andrew Kanter''s Talk feedback,\nso the check can run without a live terminology server.\n\n- TerminologyBackend interface abstracts the two primitives the matcher\n  needs (getAttributeValues, subsumes) away from any single code system.\n  SnowstormClient now implements it.\n- ConceptReferenceTermMapBackend walks concept_reference_term_map edges\n  (NARROWER-THAN / BROADER-THAN / IS-A, SAME-AS as equivalence) — the\n  RxClass ingredient-CUI -> class-NUI shape. Results are TTL-cached.\n- TerminologyBackendRouter selects snowstorm | referenceMap | both via\n  the new cdshooks.terminologyBackend global property; in \"both\" mode any\n  positive ancestry answer wins.\n- ReferenceCodeExtractor (was SnomedMappingExtractor) now surfaces\n  SNOMED, RxNORM and RxClass codes.\n- Suppress class matches anchored on overly-broad roots\n  (cdshooks.classMatchExcludedCodes) to curb alert fatigue.\n- Rename SnomedConcept -> CodedConcept / getSctid -> getCode now that the\n  matcher is terminology-neutral.\n- Add MPL 2.0 + Healthcare Disclaimer headers to all sources, LICENSE,\n  license-maven-plugin enforcement, and a GitHub Actions CI workflow.\n\nTests: unit coverage for the resolver, router, extractor and alert\nfilter, plus a context-sensitive integration test exercising the walk\nagainst a real ConceptService + H2.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"77f60cce97bc08cd6ab6fdf5e8f7ba8144705c4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jajjer/openmrs-module-cdshooks/git/trees/77f60cce97bc08cd6ab6fdf5e8f7ba8144705c4e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jajjer/openmrs-module-cdshooks/git/commits/b929b8293569304f305f1f288eb83e7b5a73af86","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74619832?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jajjer","id":74619832,"login":"jajjer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0NjE5ODMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jajjer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jajjer/openmrs-module-cdshooks/commit/b929b8293569304f305f1f288eb83e7b5a73af86","node_id":"C_kwDOSn6E69oAKGI5MjliODI5MzU2OTMwNGYzMDVmMWYyODhlYjgzZTdiNWE3M2FmODY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.