-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8073e2b7783b6087fec63a119ce29d4d700b1eac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/renatoapcosta/remote-workspace/git/trees/8073e2b7783b6087fec63a119ce29d4d700b1eac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/renatoapcosta/remote-workspace/git/commits/9ca95edd960cacccddc202ebbb344b744c4ca01d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/renatoapcosta/remote-workspace/commit/9ca95edd960cacccddc202ebbb344b744c4ca01d","node_id":"C_kwDOSn949NoAKDljYTk1ZWRkOTYwY2FjY2NkZGMyMDJlYmJiMzQ0Yjc0NGM0Y2EwMWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/renatoapcosta/remote-workspace/commit/09a0da8513657dcd7fa6c2424ed7b542befedbed","sha":"09a0da8513657dcd7fa6c2424ed7b542befedbed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/renatoapcosta/remote-workspace/commits/09a0da8513657dcd7fa6c2424ed7b542befedbed"}],"sha":"9ca95edd960cacccddc202ebbb344b744c4ca01d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/renatoapcosta/remote-workspace/commits/9ca95edd960cacccddc202ebbb344b744c4ca01d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/renatoapcosta/remote-workspace/commits/09a0da8513657dcd7fa6c2424ed7b542befedbed/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-24T19:56:41Z","email":"renato.costa@ractecnologia.com.br","name":"renato.costa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-24T19:56:41Z","email":"renato.costa@ractecnologia.com.br","name":"renato.costa"},"message":"feat(workspace): add health page for PingController and MeController testing\n\nNew page at /workspace/health with three independently testable sections:\n- GET /public/ping (no auth) — backend connectivity check\n- GET /private/me (JWT) — authenticated user info from token\n- GET /private/me/capabilities (JWT) — OPA-resolved capability keys\n\n\"Test all\" button fires all three in parallel via Promise.allSettled;\npartial failures are isolated per section. Full hexagonal architecture\nwith fake and HTTP repositories.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5e4cb7e98491865f6292c1dd0b3ea7e43a78bb2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/renatoapcosta/remote-workspace/git/trees/5e4cb7e98491865f6292c1dd0b3ea7e43a78bb2a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/renatoapcosta/remote-workspace/git/commits/09a0da8513657dcd7fa6c2424ed7b542befedbed","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/renatoapcosta/remote-workspace/commit/09a0da8513657dcd7fa6c2424ed7b542befedbed","node_id":"C_kwDOSn949NoAKDA5YTBkYTg1MTM2NTdkY2Q3ZmE2YzI0MjRlZDdiNTQyYmVmZWRiZWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/renatoapcosta/remote-workspace/commit/18a885d2c01b3c9d1463917bb23d2900aded7d60","sha":"18a885d2c01b3c9d1463917bb23d2900aded7d60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/renatoapcosta/remote-workspace/commits/18a885d2c01b3c9d1463917bb23d2900aded7d60"}],"sha":"09a0da8513657dcd7fa6c2424ed7b542befedbed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/renatoapcosta/remote-workspace/commits/09a0da8513657dcd7fa6c2424ed7b542befedbed"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/renatoapcosta/remote-workspace/commits/18a885d2c01b3c9d1463917bb23d2900aded7d60/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-24T05:02:33Z","email":"renato.costa@ractecnologia.com.br","name":"renato.costa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-24T05:02:33Z","email":"renato.costa@ractecnologia.com.br","name":"renato.costa"},"message":"feat(workspace): add diagnostics page for i18n and authorization testing\n\nNew page at /workspace/diagnostics with two sections:\n- i18n table: resolves all workspace + global nav keys, shows OK/missing status\n- Authorization form: POST /authorization/evaluate with configurable\n  capability keys and match (any/all), displays allowed/denied result\n\nFull hexagonal architecture with fake and HTTP repositories.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8e48c9b7a5644592c0e878d5929d4121bcd840bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/renatoapcosta/remote-workspace/git/trees/8e48c9b7a5644592c0e878d5929d4121bcd840bc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/renatoapcosta/remote-workspace/git/commits/18a885d2c01b3c9d1463917bb23d2900aded7d60","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/renatoapcosta/remote-workspace/commit/18a885d2c01b3c9d1463917bb23d2900aded7d60","node_id":"C_kwDOSn949NoAKDE4YTg4NWQyYzAxYjNjOWQxNDYzOTE3YmIyM2QyOTAwYWRlZDdkNjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/renatoapcosta/remote-workspace/commit/395ace2236dc998aac1b09639da837813df7542c","sha":"395ace2236dc998aac1b09639da837813df7542c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/renatoapcosta/remote-workspace/commits/395ace2236dc998aac1b09639da837813df7542c"}],"sha":"18a885d2c01b3c9d1463917bb23d2900aded7d60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/renatoapcosta/remote-workspace/commits/18a885d2c01b3c9d1463917bb23d2900aded7d60"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/renatoapcosta/remote-workspace/commits/395ace2236dc998aac1b09639da837813df7542c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-24T03:59:42Z","email":"renato.costa@ractecnologia.com.br","name":"renato.costa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-24T03:59:42Z","email":"renato.costa@ractecnologia.com.br","name":"renato.costa"},"message":"feat(workspace): add catalog page consuming GET /api/remotes/catalog\n\nNew feature with full hexagonal architecture: domain model, port,\nsignal store, fake and HTTP repositories, and table presentation page.\nRoute /workspace/catalog lists all remote catalog items with enabled\nstatus badge. Nav item and plugin contract updated.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b3b441c6c5af921ad46e79aa7871dda4fa038687","